&lt;li&gt;Documentation and white-boarding skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Emerging Enterprise &amp;amp; Digital Natives businesses, and managing conflicts across a broad stakeholder range&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build skills in technical areas, and demonstrate curiosity, adaptability, and eagerness to explore new technologies which support the deployment and integration of Databricks-based solutions to complete customer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customers 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4076 - Senior Manager, Global Resource Management – GOC (Parental Leave Cover)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager, Global Resource Management will play a key role in supporting the effective planning, deployment and utilisation of talent across the Global Operations Centres (GOCs).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will have responsibility for the &lt;strong&gt;day-to-day Resource Management of selected GOC Global clients&lt;/strong&gt;, while also leading key RM activities including &lt;strong&gt;utilisation reviews, balanced team management, bench governance and cross-GOC RM projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Capacity Planners, Staffing Strategists, Talent Acquisition, HR and market teams, the Senior Manager will help ensure client demand is effectively resourced, workforce risks are proactively identified, and RM processes are consistently managed across the GOCs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will act as a key operational partner to the GOC RM Lead, taking ownership of defined areas and escalating strategic, commercial or significant workforce decisions where required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Global Client Resource Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Resource Management for selected strategic global clients using GOC talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new global client opportunities and transitions, translating demand into clear resource requirements and staffing plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate staffing requirements across multiple GOC locations and disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Capacity Planning and Staffing teams to identify appropriate resources and drive open requirements through to fulfilment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain oversight of the client&#39;s GOC workforce, including open roles, upcoming demand, resource movements, backfills and capacity risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish an effective RM cadence with relevant client and market stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify resource issues and drive actions to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate significant commercial, capacity or stakeholder risks to the GOC RM Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Utilisation &amp;amp; Workforce Optimisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate regular utilisation reviews across GOC teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify under-utilisation, over-utilisation and available capacity and work with relevant teams to agree appropriate actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor utilisation trends and highlight emerging risks or opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure actions from utilisation reviews are tracked through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support proactive redeployment of available talent against suitable client demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide concise utilisation insights and exception reporting to the GOC RM Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Balanced Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regular reviews of team structures across GOC clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve team balance, workload distribution and appropriate management oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with RM, client and operational teams to address identified team structure or workload issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor agreed actions and ensure they are followed through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highlight structural workforce issues requiring longer-term intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Bench Management &amp;amp; Redeployment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the ongoing coordination and governance of GOC bench activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the rollout of the existing bench framework across additional GOC locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility of available resources and actively connect relevant skills and capacity with upcoming client requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate appropriate bench project opportunities where immediate billable deployment is not available.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track bench movements and provide visibility of key risks, ageing cases and redeployment opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with relevant GOC stakeholders to ensure consistent adoption of the bench process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Resource Planning &amp;amp; Operational Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support on complex staffing requirements that require coordination across multiple markets, clients, disciplines or GOCs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist Capacity Planners and Staffing teams with more complex resource challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key staffing risks, blockers and ageing requirements and help drive them towards resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Finance, Talent Acquisition, HR and other functions where additional support is required to fulfil resource needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support workforce and capacity planning activities by ensuring emerging demand and supply risks are visible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; RM Projects &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver selected Resource Management projects and improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the rollout of consistent RM practices across GOC locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify manual RM processes and improve ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support improvements to RM reporting, dashboards and workforce visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead agreed workstreams such as:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bench management rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balanced Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilisation governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RM reporting and dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process standardisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills and capability visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will ideally have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Resource Management, People Operations, or a related area is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a hands-on role that requires someone who is motivated to make an impact, not simply tick boxes; it requires initiative, ownership and an appetite for challenge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, proactive, organisation and influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing resource requirements across multiple clients, teams or geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of utilisation, capacity management and workforce deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to convert workforce data into practical actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder-management skills and confidence working with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and drive actions to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering cross-functional projects or process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills with a practical, solutions-focused approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently while recognising when issues require senior escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager will be successful when:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selected global clients have clear, proactive RM ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex staffing requirements are driven to resolution without requiring continuous intervention from the GOC RM Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilisation and balanced-team reviews result in &lt;strong&gt;clear actions and follow-through&lt;/strong&gt;, rather than simply reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bench capacity is visible and actively managed across GOCs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RM initiatives are delivered consistently across locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity Planning and Staffing teams have an effective senior operational escalation point.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Major workforce risks are identified early and escalated with clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2931 - Associate Director, Activation &amp;amp; Delivery, GCS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce Account Director to lead the strategic development, execution, and performance of integrated biddable activity across &lt;strong&gt;Google Ads (Search, Shopping, Performance Max)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Amazon Search&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior leader within the team, you will be responsible for &lt;strong&gt;defining and delivering best-in-class search and ecommerce strategies&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring alignment with broader client business goals and full-funnel media objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the &lt;strong&gt;senior client contact&lt;/strong&gt;, working with stakeholders at Director level and above, while leading cross-functional teams and offshore delivery hubs to execute against strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines &lt;strong&gt;deep platform expertise, strategic leadership, and operational oversight&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring campaigns are executed to the highest standard while continuously driving innovation and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of holistic Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce strategies across:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Ads (Search, Shopping, Performance Max)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazon Search (Sponsored Ads ecosystem)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strategies are aligned to client business objectives, KPIs, and commercial priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate broader marketing strategy into channel-specific activation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities across demand capture (Search) and retail media (Amazon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive integration between Search, Ecommerce, and wider media channels (Paid Social, Programmatic, SEO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop forward-thinking POVs on industry trends, platform developments, and emerging opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client and Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary senior contact for Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce across your client portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with senior stakeholders, becoming a trusted strategic advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead client meetings, presentations, quarterly reviews, and strategic planning sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulate performance, insights, and forward strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to grow client investment and expand scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Performance and Campaign&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain ultimate accountability for performance delivery across all Search &amp;amp; Ecommerce activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign execution across Google Ads and Amazon platforms, ensuring alignment with strategy
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure robust optimisation frameworks are in place across:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bidding &amp;amp; automation (e.g., Smart Bidding, PMAX optimisation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed optimisation (Shopping / Amazon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Query, audience, and keyword strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead performance reviews, identifying risks and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure rigorous testing frameworks are defined and executed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all campaigns are delivered &lt;strong&gt;on time, within budget, and to the highest standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong governance across:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QA processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial management and invoicing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform best practice adherence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements in workflows, automation, and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clear documentation of processes and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead development of &lt;strong&gt;test &amp;amp; learn roadmaps&lt;/strong&gt; across Search and Ecommerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to leverage new platform capabilities (e.g., PMAX, AI bidding, Amazon innovations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to agency thought leadership, case studies, and award submissions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in the wider Search and Commerce communities within WPP Media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onshore–Offshore Delivery Model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and manage ways of working between onshore strategy teams and offshore execution teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure offshore teams are set up for success with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear briefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defined processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QA frameworks and performance standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee output quality across offshore Account Managers and Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive scalability, efficiency, and operational excellence across delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of Account Managers and Account Executives (onshore and offshore)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide coaching, mentorship, and performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure effective workload allocation, prioritisation, and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support hiring and team growth aligned to client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a high-performing, collaborative, and innovative team culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience across:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Ads (Search, Shopping, Performance Max)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazon Search / Retail Media ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading performance-driven search and ecommerce strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of full-funnel media strategy and cross-channel integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical skills with ability to translate data into actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing large-scale, complex accounts and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client leadership experience, including senior stakeholder management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and developing multi-layered teams (including offshore models)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of bidding strategies, feed-based media, automation, and measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we&#39;re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we&#39;ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forward Deployed AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global AI Strategy &amp;amp; Solutions defines how DEPT®’s clients respond as AI agents become the primary layer between customers and brands. The Future of the Customer Journey (FCJ) is the team’s flagship offer: it maps how AI systems intermediate customer journeys, diagnoses where a brand’s product reality diverges from what AI systems say about it, and directs investment accordingly. Growth and strategy teams across markets are selling and delivering it now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;Forward Deployed AI Engineer, you are an embedded builder inside that motion. You will sit with growth and strategy teams, understand the problem in front of them, and answer with working software rather than documentation. You will convert FCJ methodology into agentic components, prototypes, and internal tools, and integrate with infrastructure that lets new prototypes appear in days. When needed, you will work across global client projects on a partially billable basis, making sure the firm-wide strategy is captured and implemented properly rather than reinvented market by market. As components mature, you will collaborate with product and craft teams to keep everything compatible with the long-term platform and hand over cleanly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be given broad problem statements to help collaborate and solve, not specific product ideas and features to create. We are not looking for someone to lead on devops or CI/CD, this is about having great ideas that are sensitive to our clients’ real challenges, and shipping prototypes and strategic tools rapidly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your most important collaboration is with the FCJ core team on the global growth strategy: deciding what gets built next, for which market, to unlock which engagement. The toolchain will keep changing underneath you, new models, new vendor products, new technology-partner platforms, and that is the point. This role suits an engineer who learns by shipping and treats every new AI product as something to master in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the FCJ core team on the global growth strategy, converting methodology into working agentic components, prototypes, and internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with growth and strategy teams to understand their problems and provide working solutions at prototype pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across global client projects on a partially billable basis, ensuring the firm-wide FCJ strategy is captured and implemented consistently across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product and craft teams where necessary to document integration paths, maintain platform compatibility, and hand over validated components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with technology partners to evaluate, adopt, and integrate new AI products; maintain an AI-native toolchain and share what works across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience prototyping and shipping software in any modern backend language (Python, TypeScript, Go, or similar), with the ability to leverage AI tooling to spin up prototype frontends and APIs quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building applications across the mainstream LLM model families (Gemini, GPT, Claude), connecting models to enterprise data and tools using patterns such as retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) and skills-based agent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in working with APIs to connect different services, authentication, data exchange, and integration across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing agentic systems with orchestration frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native way of working: AI tooling is the default across coding, research, and delivery, with comfort spanning the tools in use across different markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a forward-deployed, customer engineering, solutions engineering, or applied AI role within an agency, consultancy, or AI company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting working software to non-technical stakeholders, including strategists and clients, and iterating live on their feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of emerging integration standards such as OpenAPI and Model Context Protocol (MCP) for connecting agents to business systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of any of the following: paid media, social platforms, user behaviour, agentic commerce, or generative engine optimisation (GEO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with evaluation, tracing, and observability for LLM applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated learning mindset: a record of adopting new AI products from technology partners quickly, learning by doing rather than waiting for training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid working policy (2 days from the office in London).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent salary based on experience and equal pay policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension, free private healthcare, mental health support, and company sick pay scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days paid holiday (plus UK Bank Holidays).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help getting you to work with a season ticket loan and cycle to work scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family friendly policies to support new parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social and Cultural Events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspirational Talks, bringing the outside in with regular guest speakers and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development, supporting your growth with continuous opportunities to learn and advance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buddy Programme: You will be paired with a ‘Buddy’ to help you through your first weeks’ at DEPT®.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/&quot;&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global annual &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt; in which employees come together and donate their skills to support local charities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hi 👋 we’re Genio. We create beautifully simple learning tools that boost knowledge, skills, and confidence.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a SaaS scale up and one of the fastest growing tech companies in the North.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There’s 90+ of us around the UK with our HQ in Leeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our software is award-winning and used by 100,000s of students at over 1,000 universities &amp;amp; colleges worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re growing so we can achieve our mission to support 1 million students to become better learners by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career track:&lt;/strong&gt; IC4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Shared services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Platform Engineer, you help set the strategy for Genio&#39;s infrastructure end-to-end — from design through to running it in production. You work with squads on feature work to advise/set direction, and ensure reliability, security, and cost efficiency. You drive the design and implementation of best-practice cloud infrastructure, automation frameworks, and tooling that enable scalability, reliability, and efficiency for engineering teams in both business units. Working closely with engineers, testers, and data colleagues, you lead initiatives to enhance platform capabilities, optimise performance, and champion DevOps principles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolving Genio&#39;s cloud infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect and optimise cloud infrastructure to ensure scalability, security, and resilience. Shape long-term infrastructure strategy and apply Infrastructure as Code and CI/CD best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintaining and improving observability of Genio&#39;s applications:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement comprehensive monitoring, alerting, and distributed tracing capabilities. Champion the adoption of SLOs, SLAs, and SLIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading incidents and post-incident learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Support as an incident lead for PlatformOps, coordinate the response, run blameless post-incident reviews, and track actions to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving automation of repetitive tasks:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop scalable automation frameworks to streamline engineering workflows and improve efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raising the technical capability of other teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a technical advisor, provide guidance and upskilling support for platform tooling, and mentor engineers across engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👥 Meet the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the &lt;strong&gt;Principal Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; and work most closely with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Principal Platform Engineer (Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform Engineer (Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering teams in both business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Support Engineer (Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Data Engineer (Operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems design and judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; Takes an ambiguous problem, defines options, makes trade-offs explicit, and writes clear design documents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience in scripting and programming with Python and/or Bash for automation and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient with Terraform for infrastructure automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong experience with AWS or Google Cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes in production:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience operating, upgrading, networking, and debugging Kubernetes clusters under load.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability Engineering &amp;amp; Security:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ownership of production service reliability (defining SLIs, incident response) and implementing security practices (access control, secrets management, patching, backup/recovery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus / Nice to have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Assisted Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable and proficient with AI development tools as part of everyday engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cost Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of infrastructure costs and the ability to build cases for spending changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to mentor others, foster trust, make pragmatic technology choices, and communicate with &quot;passionate views, loosely held&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💰Salary and benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸£70,000- £76,000 per annum dependent on experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖️ 33 days annual leave (Inclusive of bank holidays)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎄 3 gifted days off at Christmas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 EMI Share Options Scheme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎓 Generous individual learning and training allowance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⌚ Truly flexible hours to suit when you work best&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💻 Full home working set up and beautiful collaborative office space&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 Free Leeds City Centre office parking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Nomad working policy with family travel insurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 Enhanced 26 weeks maternity and 4 weeks paternity (fully paid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤍 Health cash plan (from glasses to massages)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸 6% employer pension contribution&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our beautiful office space in Leeds is our key hub for collaboration, and we love to get together in person. We operate a flexible hybrid working model, including supporting our Genios who are based remotely across the UK. If you are more than 50 miles away from the office, we offer full remote working support within the UK, with the opportunity to join colleagues for in-person collaboration several times a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will discuss ways of working with you at interview however if you have any questions before you apply please reach out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 What to expect next:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll review your application and provide a response within 1 week. Even if it’s not the news you’d hoped for, we appreciate it’s good to know either way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we invite you to meet with us for interview, here’s an overview of what the process will look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screening interview with our Recruitment Business Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A take-home technical test for you to complete offline and submit back to us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A technical interview with Mark, Staff Platform Engineer and an Engineer from the Platform Operations team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A CV review and Cultural &amp;amp; Values interview with Mark and our Head of Engineering, Mala&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ahead of your interview you will receive a confirmation email outlining who you’ll be meeting and when, anything you’ll need to prepare in advance and any resources we think you might find helpful.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👀 Interested in learning more about a career at Genio?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are a few further resources:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://genio.co/about&quot;&gt;About Genio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://genio.co/about/careers/life-at-genio&quot;&gt;Life at Genio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://genio.co/resources/case-studies-and-user-stories&quot;&gt;Case studies and user stories&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💌 Not quite the right role for you however you’d love to be a part of Genio’s journey?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let’s connect! Reach out to &lt;a ---------- and we’ll add you to our network, to keep you updated with any future opportunities we think you might be interested in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📄 Applicant Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We think it’s important that you understand how we use and handle your personal information, so here’s a link to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://glean.co/glean-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;privacy notice.&lt;/a&gt; By submitting your application, you’re confirming that you’ve read and understood this notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;**Please note this position requires weekly travel to/attendance at project sites. Locations could vary across the Nordics and EMEA**&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nscale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Nscale, we are building the infrastructure for Europe’s AI revolution. Nscale are developing cutting-edge sovereign generative AI solutions, powered by a new generation of high-performance, sustainable data centres and GPUs built specifically for AI workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The growth of artificial intelligence is driving unprecedented global demand for compute and GPU infrastructure. Nscale is positioned at the heart of this transformation — building the platforms that will enable the next decade of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nscale are working closely with the world’s most advanced AI technology providers, integrating next-gen compute hardware and GPU clusters in both partner and Nscale built facilities. This is an opportunity to join Nscale’s journey, play a key role in delivering transformative AI infrastructure, and help shape a company designed to scale rapidly across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Senior Project Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;will play a leading role in managing the construction of Nscale’s data centre facilities, with a particular focus on fit-out / partnered projects. Reporting to the Project Director, this role may be sat across individual projects or multiple concurrently depending on scale and scope of project pipeline, and will be responsible for ensuring projects are delivered successfully by coordinating design, engineering, and construction activities through each stage of project execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will manage scope, schedule, progress, quality, and risk, ensuring consistency with Nscale’s standards, governance, and delivery objectives.You will coordinate with internal team members and external partners to deliver on time, safely, and to specification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will maintain visibility of project budgets, forecasts, and reporting to ensure informed and proactive decision-making. Collaboration across internal teams — including Engineering, EH&amp;amp;S, Finance, and Operations — will be key to delivering world-class, sustainable infrastructure that supports Nscale’s AI mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead data centre project delivery from design through construction, commissioning, and operational handover.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project scope, schedule, and quality, ensuring alignment with design intent and business objectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and lead discipline Project Management (MEP, CSA) when required and ensure all packages of work integrate smoothly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain oversight of project budgets and schedules in coordination with the Commercial Manager, reporting progress and highlighting key risks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Design for design reviews, approvals, and documentation control.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with general contractors to assess and manage local construction capabilities, resource planning, and performance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adherence to program milestones, identifying potential delays and developing recovery plans.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a strong safety culture, ensuring compliance through active engagement and auditing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chair regular status meetings, issue reports, and maintain clear communication between stakeholders and leadership.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support compliance with building codes and regulatory requirements, advising on design implications or alternative solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead risk identification and resolution, ensuring issues are captured, tracked, and addressed early.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with internal departments (Engineering, EH&amp;amp;S, Finance, Operations) to ensure seamless project delivery and transition to operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 8 years of experience managing large-scale, mission-critical construction projects, including expertise in data centre developments and fit-out works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally you will have delivered projects integrating TCS loop liquid cooling networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Construction Management, Engineering, Architecture, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage complex, multi-discipline delivery teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of construction sequencing, scheduling, and coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to lead effectively in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in project management and reporting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of commercial and contractual principles sufficient to ensure alignment with cost and schedule targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information on how Nscale handles candidate personal data, please see our Employee &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QK5Yg04WHD9K9IAtJgQWubJZC9oLvatK/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1765375172804000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ncte4rmlGl8OKuFuDgDtx&quot;&gt;Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nscale does not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from recruitment agencies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have created a new standard in ransomware incident response and need a leader to help us take our client experience to the next level. We are looking for an experienced incident response operator / leader to help us continue to shape our product and service. Your work will help companies from around the world recover from cyber-attacks. We want you to play a major part in raising the bar as we continue our growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will handle incident response cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will own the customer experience from onboarding through case closed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will provide guidance to clients seeking visibility on how their cases will progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will negotiate with cyber criminals. You will manage financial operations associated with settlements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will interact with our commercial partners, and our partners in law enforcement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for following and improving our operations compliance procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our case operations and the eﬃciency of our throughput are in your hands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have the opportunity to travel and speak on behalf of the company to clients and at industry gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about ensuring clients have an amazing experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to abstract operational patterns, bottlenecks and conjure both process and technology solutions that improve customer experience and internal eﬃciency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are willing to roll up your sleeves and play individual contributor, when necessary, but are also keen to grow and scale a team. You have experience in incident response operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are interested in building a product and contributing by distilling customer experience and feedback to ensure the right features get prioritized. You are data driven by default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand and respect proper controls, regulations and policies that guide operational success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a clear and articulate communicator with customers and your co-workers alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how to manage a project and communicate with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy cultivating internal relationships and are comfortable giving and receiving candid feedback when it comes to performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cyber incident response within the private sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 1 year of management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting and building a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cyber security qualifications / certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days, plus 4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical, dental, and vision insurance with dependent enrolment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance with enhanced coverage and global 24/7 protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection after 26 weeks, covering a portion of salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defined contribution pension plan with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worldwide travel insurance for business and leisure, with option to enroll dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program with therapy, legal, and financial support, plus online GP services and wellbeing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If an applicant is permanently located outside of the United Kingdom, Veeam reserves the right to decline the application for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AF1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;56095010243a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Veeam Software is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt; and does not tolerate discrimination in any form on the basis of race, color, religion, gender, age, national origin, citizenship, disability, veteran status or any other classification protected by federal, state or local law. All your information will be kept confidential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data collected during the recruitment process will be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.veeam.com/legal/recruiting-privacy-notice.html&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how your information is collected, used, and handled in connection with hiring activities. By applying for this position, you consent to this processing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you confirm that the information provided, including any supporting documents, is complete and accurate to the best of your knowledge. Any misrepresentation, omission, or falsification may result in disqualification from consideration or, if discovered after employment begins, termination of employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;app&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a fully remote position and we&#39;re considering candidates in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Product Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at Grafana Labs, you&#39;ll develop a vision and strategy for your product domain. You will own your product’s roadmap, collateral, and market research, and you will collaborate with Grafana leadership on fine-tuning your product’s goals. You will be the primary advocate and expert in your area, with a strong ability to communicate needs, functionality, and details effectively both to external customers and internal stakeholders. The teams and people you will be interacting with will be 100% remote and globally distributed, so strong and proactive communication is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Managers are the bridge that connect Engineering, Design, and UX to GTM. You are a facilitator who ensures the free flow of information across these teams and are expected to be technically proficient when representing our products to our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Product Manager for Application Observability (App O11y),&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll be responsible for helping application developers and SREs understand how their applications are performing, what’s affecting their users, and where to focus when something goes wrong. You’ll continue to build App O11y on top of the Knowledge Graph and fully integrate high-fidelity signals like traces and profiles, making all three first-class parts of the product experience. You’ll bring these capabilities together into our full-stack observability experience, alongside our Drilldown products, while building AI-first workflows that help customers investigate issues, understand root cause, and take action beyond static experiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your primary responsibility will be to define the vision and roadmap that takes App O11y into its next wave of adoption and revenue growth. This will require heavy customer discovery, using product data to understand where users get stuck, and working with your engineering and design partners to turn those needs into clear priorities. You’ll balance new product opportunities with the depth, performance, and reliability customers need from tracing and profiling, while working across R&amp;amp;D to ensure App O11y is tightly woven into our broader Grafana Cloud suite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also work closely with PMM and GTM to help customers understand the value of App O11y. This includes shaping pricing and packaging that make it easy to get started and grow with the product. You’ll regularly review customer feedback and usage data to understand what’s working and where people get stuck, and then be accountable for turning what you learn into stronger adoption and revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at Grafana Labs, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform ideas and feedback into a product vision and roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathize with customer problems in order to collect user needs, requirements, and pain points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curate and properly represent user feedback to Engineering, while providing evidence to support tradeoffs and priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with PMM to enable GTM on product differentiation, including creating and updating presentations, documentation, website content, datasheets, and whitepapers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your deep product expertise to make decisions about our go-to-market strategies, pricing, packaging, licensing and tiering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform ideas and feedback into a product vision and roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathize with customer problems in order to collect user needs, requirements, and pain points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curate and properly represent user feedback to Engineering, while providing evidence to support tradeoffs and priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with PMM to enable GTM on product differentiation, including creating and updating presentations, documentation, website content, datasheets, and whitepapers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your deep product expertise to make decisions about our go-to-market strategies, pricing, packaging, licensing and tiering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;What makes you a great fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A BS/BA in Computer Science, a related field, or equivalent work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Product Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a B2B SaaS product&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using or building observability products, telemetry databases, and/or developer tools, either as a practitioner or for external customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of application architectures and distributed systems, with the ability to discuss tradeoffs in telemetry ingestion, storage, querying, and the workflows built on top&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Engineering and Design teams to build delightful products and features with sound UX in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to influence cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with OpenTelemetry, application instrumentation, SDKs, and telemetry collectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed tracing or continuous profiling systems, such as Grafana Tempo or Grafana Pyroscope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with eBPF and/or automatic instrumentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with open source software and/or commercial open source companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining or evolving pricing and packaging for consumption-based or product-led SaaS offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating applications in production, being on call, or troubleshooting performance and reliability issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In the UK, the base compensation range for this role is GBP &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;94,508 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;- 113,410&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Architecture Team partners with our users to realize their full potential through the adoption of prescriptive solutions that drive their growth and success. We influence revenue growth across Stripe’s product portfolio, and collaborate with sales, support, product management, and Stripe’s executive team to provide the best experience to our most valued customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of the team, the Solutions Architect will build highly consultative trusted relationships with c-level executives and technical decision makers in the customer’s organization to provide business and technical thought leadership, and become a trusted advisor in solving mission-critical business challenges. She/he will architect business models with them so they can drive new monetization opportunities and growth for both the user and Stripe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a key member of a Stripe account team with deep involvement in defining the customer strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close new complex opportunities, and accelerate solution adoption. Understand and align with the customer’s product and business roadmap and uncover opportunities for Stripe to accelerate their progress on that roadmap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive thought leadership and be a trusted advisor for key business and technical stakeholders including CIO, CTO, COO, CRO, CDO, Head of Product Engineering and Head of Payments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work to deeply understand the customer’s business objectives, and then design and apply Stripe’s solutions to their challenges. Develop and articulate the end to end customer transformation journey and create future roadmaps and architectures with deep 3rd party integrations in play.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct business analysis and background research on customers, industries, and competitors with a view to support growth for the user&#39;s business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategy engagements with users to align to business priorities, design solutions and secure the technical win by performing in-depth customer discovery, evangelizing the proposed solutions through executive briefings, readouts, presentations, workshops and solution demos.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand Stripe’s footprint within existing accounts to new global markets and business units by introducing new capabilities and local payment methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the “Voice of the Customer” to bring insights, trends and opportunities to the leadership, product and engineering teams from the forefront and prioritized for delivery.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in sales forecasting, Quarterly Business Reviews and account/territory planning to strategically and tactically align for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 25% travel is anticipated to help you connect in-person in a meaningful way with users and collaborate internally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have achieved an experienced position as an enterprise architect, senior solution architect or principal solution engineer and have a successful track record advising enterprise-grade digital native / SAAS / Platform / Marketplace companies, focused on identifying business priorities, formulating technology strategies and designing an end-to-end business solution. You possess deep technical acumen, high interpersonal and leadership skills, and have demonstrated the ability to become a trusted advisor to senior executives and facilitate customer success along the entire customer journey.&amp;nbsp; Strategic and creative thinker who can proactively identify challenges, take ownership, and maintain a positive approach when facing difficult obstacles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in a similar customer-facing engineering role such as solution consultant, solutions architect, sales engineer, for a global software enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the payments/ billing / invoicing / issuing / banking / Fintech space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive engagement skills and presence, with an ability to establish strong relationships with key decision makers and build credibility at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective group-facilitation skills and confidence in proposing and leading customer meetings to gain strategic footing and pursue opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thorough understanding of the software development lifecycle and API architectures. A background in writing code in any of Stripe’s primary deployment languages (Ruby, Python, JavaScript, Java, Go, etc.) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding spoken and written communication skills, presentation skills, and confident in explaining complex concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently in a highly ambiguous and fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion to take on ownership and drive change in a constantly evolving environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior verbal and written communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel per business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a growth stage internet/software company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans un souci de clarté et d’accessibilité, nous avons choisi de ne pas utiliser l’écriture inclusive dans nos communications. WPP Media est fermement engagé en faveur de la diversité : nous valorisons l&#39;inclusion et l&#39;égalité, en considérant tous les candidats sans distinction d&#39;identité de genre, d&#39;origine ethnique ou de religion. Tous nos postes sont également ouverts aux personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de WPP Media :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP est le partenaire de confiance des plus grandes marques mondiales pour assurer leur croissance.&lt;/strong&gt; Nous réunissons une intelligence média de pointe, une créativité de classe mondiale, une production de nouvelle génération, des solutions pour transformer le marketing à l’ère de l’IA et un conseil stratégique d’expert au sein d’une seule compagnie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propulsés par des talents exceptionnels et WPP Open, notre plateforme de marketing agentique, nous déployons l’IA à grande échelle pour aider nos clients à naviguer dans un monde en pleines mutations et à optimiser leurs investissements marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour plus d’informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;www.wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media est le collectif média global de WPP. Dans un monde où les médias sont omniprésents, nous regroupons la meilleure plateforme, les meilleurs talents et les meilleurs partenaires pour développer les solutions les plus innovantes, offrant une croissance inégalée à nos clients. Pour plus d&#39;informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;https://wppmedia.com/&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez WPP Media, nous croyons en la puissance de notre culture et de nos collaborateurs. C&#39;est grâce à cette synergie que nous parvenons à créer des expériences véritablement exceptionnelles, tant pour nos clients que pour nos équipes internes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour réussir dans ce poste, il est fondamental d&#39;incarner les valeurs essentielles qui unissent WPP et WPP Media :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Être Extraordinaire&lt;/strong&gt; en favorisant un leadership collectif qui inspire une créativité véritablement transformationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Créer un environnement Ouvert&lt;/strong&gt; en trouvant l&#39;équilibre parfait entre l&#39;épanouissement de nos collaborateurs et la satisfaction de nos clients, le tout fondé sur une confiance mutuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diriger avec Optimisme&lt;/strong&gt; en stimulant activement la croissance et le développement pour mobiliser l&#39;ensemble de notre organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rôle et missions :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rattaché au &lt;strong&gt;Head of Social Media&lt;/strong&gt; et en coordination étroite avec le &lt;strong&gt;Head of Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, vous pilotez un portefeuille de clients clés et participez activement au développement de l’agence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous concevez des stratégies de contenu innovantes pour les écosystèmes de nos marques clientes en intégrant les cibles, les nouveaux usages, les plateformes sociales et les enjeux de &lt;em&gt;brand experience&lt;/em&gt;, tant sur le volet éditorial que sur l&#39;influence marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos responsabilités s&#39;articulent autour de 3 grands axes :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Conseil Stratégique &amp;amp; Relation Client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stratégie &amp;amp; Recommandations :&lt;/strong&gt; Écriture et pilotage des recommandations stratégiques Social Media &amp;amp; Influence (fil rouge et temps forts) pour les marques de votre portefeuille ; définition et suivi des KPI de performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soutenance &amp;amp; Restitution :&lt;/strong&gt; Présentation orale des recommandations et des bilans stratégiques auprès des annonceurs, en vous appuyant sur votre équipe et en synergie avec les pôles experts de l’agence (&lt;em&gt;Content Strategy&lt;/em&gt;, Production, Événementiel, Média).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Satisfaction :&lt;/strong&gt; Suivi rigoureux de la relation client, garantie du bon déploiement opérationnel des campagnes, respect des plannings, gestion des budgets et rentabilité financière des projets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Développement Commercial &amp;amp; Offre&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business &amp;amp; Croissance :&lt;/strong&gt; Pilotage des briefs entrants (Inbizz et NewBizz) et participation active au développement du portefeuille clients et du chiffre d&#39;affaires de la Business Unit Studio M.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement de l’offre Influence :&lt;/strong&gt; Contribution à l’enrichissement des méthodologies et outils (GOAT, outils de veille/social listening) et développement des relations avec les créateurs de contenu, agences de management et maisons artistiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Management &amp;amp; Synergies d’Équipe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Management d’équipe :&lt;/strong&gt; Encadrement, formation et montée en compétences de 1 à 3 personnes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation &amp;amp; Process :&lt;/strong&gt; Mise en place des process de collaboration pour accompagner la progression et la fidélisation des talents au sein de l&#39;équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transversalité :&lt;/strong&gt; Développement des synergies au quotidien avec les autres expertises de WPP Media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Profil recherché :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; De formation supérieure (Bac+5 en marketing, communication, médias ou école de commerce), vous justifiez d’au moins &lt;strong&gt;6 ans d’expérience&lt;/strong&gt; en agence (Social Media, média ou globale) sur la gestion de comptes d&#39;envergure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Métier :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellente culture des plateformes sociales, des tendances de contenu, des mécaniques d&#39;activation d&#39;influence et de l&#39;écosystème des créateurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sens Stratégique &amp;amp; Business :&lt;/strong&gt; Fortes capacités d&#39;analyse, d&#39;écriture stratégique et aisance à l&#39;oral pour pitcher devant des directions marketing. Sensibilité financière (gestion de marge, suivi de P&amp;amp;L projet).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership :&lt;/strong&gt; Expérience réussie en management ou tutorat d&#39;équipe, esprit d’écoute, bienveillance et rigueur opérationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise courante de l’anglais (écrit et oral), indispensable dans notre environnement international.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;La vie chez WPP Media et ses avantages :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre engagement à façonner l&#39;avenir des médias se manifeste par un soutien actif au développement professionnel de nos talents, les aidant à atteindre leur plein potentiel. Cette démarche s&#39;accompagne d&#39;une vision responsable dans nos stratégies d&#39;investissement médiatique, reflétant ainsi notre double priorité : valoriser nos collaborateurs tout en adoptant des pratiques durables dans notre secteur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les collaborateurs de WPP Media ont un accès privilégié aux réseaux internationaux de WPP Media et WPP, leur permettant de développer leurs passions, d&#39;étendre leur réseau professionnel et de rester à la pointe des innovations en marketing et publicité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous disposons de ressources vastes et variées au service de nos collaborateurs, notre entreprise cultive activement l&#39;inclusion des talents de tous horizons. Les réussites et expertises des équipes sont régulièrement mises en lumière lors d&#39;événements fédérateurs qui ponctuent également les moments clés de l&#39;année, renforçant ainsi notre culture d&#39;entreprise collaborative et diversifiée.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos avantages comprennent :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Télétravail :&lt;/strong&gt; jusqu&#39;à 2 jours par semaine et 2 semaines complètes à prendre en deux fois dans l’année.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Congés offerts :&lt;/strong&gt; 2 jours de repos supplémentaires offerts, dont le lundi de Pentecôte.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ancienneté :&lt;/strong&gt; Jours de congé additionnels par palier de 5 ans d’ancienneté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Santé &amp;amp; Équité :&lt;/strong&gt; 5 jours de télétravail additionnels par mois pour les collaboratrices souffrant d’endométriose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Politique handicap :&lt;/strong&gt; 3 jours d&#39;absence autorisés payés par an, accès à des Chèques Emploi Service Universel (CESU), et accompagnements spécifiques pour les collaborateurs ayant une RQTH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement sociétal :&lt;/strong&gt; Missions solidaires possibles via le programme &lt;em&gt;We care and we act&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools &amp;amp; Innovation :&lt;/strong&gt; Accès à des outils performants et à la pointe de la technologie pour la gestion des campagnes, l&#39;écoute et le reporting (WPP Open).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Process de recrutement :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous nous engageons à rendre ce process aussi rapide et efficace que possible, et à maintenir une communication ouverte et transparente tout au long du process :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien avec l’équipe Recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt; Un premier échange téléphonique ou par vidéoconférence avec l’équipe Talent pour aborder votre parcours et vos aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien Opérationnel :&lt;/strong&gt; Un échange approfondi avec le manager du poste pour échanger sur vos expériences, la vision du pôle et les enjeux clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étude de cas :&lt;/strong&gt; Une mise en situation concrète (cas pratique stratégique Social Media &amp;amp; Influence) suivie d’une restitution orale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media garantit l&#39;égalité des chances et considère tous les candidats sans discrimination ni considération de caractéristiques particulières. Nous nous engageons à cultiver un environnement de respect où chacun se sent à sa place et bénéficie des mêmes opportunités d&#39;évolution professionnelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consultez notre politique de confidentialité pour tout savoir sur la &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;politique de confidentialité&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bien que nous étudiions toutes les candidatures reçues, nous ne contactons que les personnes sélectionnées pour un entretien.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#&lt;span class=&quot;markhrwveqse0&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbtc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbrc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbbc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsblc=&quot;&quot;&gt;LI&lt;/span&gt;-&lt;span class=&quot;markmnhqy0nfk&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbtc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbrc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbbc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsblc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dans un souci de clarté et d’accessibilité, nous avons choisi de ne pas utiliser l’écriture inclusive dans nos communications. WPP Media est fermement engagé en faveur de la diversité : nous valorisons l&#39;inclusion et l&#39;égalité, en considérant tous les candidats sans distinction d&#39;identité de genre, d&#39;origine ethnique ou de religion. Tous nos postes sont également ouverts aux personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;A propos de WPP Media :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. Nous utilisons le pouvoir de la créativité pour construire un avenir meilleur pour nos collaborateurs, notre planète, nos clients et nos communautés. Pour plus d&#39;informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/fr-fr&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;wpp.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media est le collectif média global de WPP.&amp;nbsp;Dans un monde où les médias sont omniprésents nous regroupons la meilleure plateforme, les meilleurs talents et les meilleurs partenaires pour développer les solutions les plus innovantes, offrant une croissance inégalée à nos clients. &lt;br&gt;Pour plus d&#39;informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez WPP Media, nous croyons en la puissance de notre culture et de nos collaborateurs. C&#39;est grâce à cette synergie que nous parvenons à créer des expériences véritablement exceptionnelles, tant pour nos clients que pour nos équipes internes. Pour réussir dans ce poste, il est fondamental d&#39;incarner les valeurs essentielles qui unissent WPP et WPP Media :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Être Extraordinaire&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;en favorisant un leadership collectif qui inspire une créativité véritablement transformationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Créer un environnement Ouvert&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;en trouvant l&#39;équilibre parfait entre l&#39;épanouissement de nos collaborateurs et la satisfaction de nos clients, le tout fondé sur une confiance mutuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diriger avec Optimisme&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;en stimulant activement la croissance et le développement pour mobiliser l&#39;ensemble de notre organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rôle et Impact&amp;nbsp;: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant qu’Account Manager, vous serez responsable de l&#39;élaboration des recommandations que ce soit avec un mode d’achat en programmatique ou en gré à gré. Il est également garant de la mise en place, du suivi, optimisations. Il encadre également un Account Executive ou alternant dans sa formation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veille marché&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rencontre régulière des différents partenaires (média, data, techno)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assister aux product update des plateformes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion briefs &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réception, analyse et compréhension des problématiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vérification de l’exhaustivité des informations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Echanges avec l’agence, challenge du brief et identification du rendu attendu (powerpoint, excel, mail…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annonce d’un délai de retour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rédaction de recommandation &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elaboration des stratégies display programmatiques et/ou gré à gré selon le brief (Créations, Stratégie d’achat, inventaires, ciblages, technos…) avec le soutien de l’AMS ou du TL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Echanges avec les partenaires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Négociations des coûts d’achat si le deal n’existe pas ou pour le GàG&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mise en forme de la réponse en respectant les templates existants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restitution de la recommandation au client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tracking/Trafficking&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définition du plan de tracking (visite du site, pixels à poser etc…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garant de la bonne mise en place des éléments de tracking (vérification des loads dans le DSP, + vérification remontées outils tiers DAR, IAS…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vérification de la bonne mise en place de l’adverificateur selon les normes GroupM et/ou annonceur (pré bid, coordination avec adops)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Envoi des spec techs + tenue à jour du document&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réception des éléments créatifs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vérification de la conformité le jour de la réception (avant envoi à l’audit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Envoi à l’audit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programmation des campagnes&amp;nbsp;: Rigueur opérationnelle dans la programmation, le suivi et le reporting. &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programmatique&amp;nbsp;: &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmation de la campagne dans le(s) DSP choisi(s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégration des paramètres «&amp;nbsp;qualité&amp;nbsp;» (visibilité, sitelist/exclusion list…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vérification du setup avec les outils internes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilotage de la campagne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gré à Gré&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Envoi des éléments de campagnes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégration des paramètres «&amp;nbsp;qualité&amp;nbsp;» (visibilité, sitelist/exclusion list…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previews créations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pige de mise en ligne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pilotage de la campagne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Suivi &amp;amp; optimisations &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Garant de la bonne livraison, des résultats et de la qualité des activations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Edition d’un reporting régulier 1 mois par semaine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identification des actions à mener pour optimiser la campagne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mise en place des optimisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Envoi du reporting avec explication des optimisations réalisées et leur but&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tenue à jour du document de suivi mis en place pour chaque pôle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilan&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identification de la forme souhaitée (excel vs powerpoint)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Création du bilan final de la campagne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explication des résultats et notamment de l’impact des optimisations (résultats, enseignements, savings le cas échéant, pistes de reflexion/next steps)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Présentation client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Finance&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer le suivi budgétaire de la campagne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer le suivi des impressions data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;En fin de campagne effectuer le bilan d’achat&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proximité agence&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Point physique régulier avec ses contacts en agence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Space planning&amp;nbsp;: si possible un jour partagé avec ses contacts agence&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Expérience et Compétences&amp;nbsp;: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience Professionnelle :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plus de 3 ans d&#39;expérience significative et réussie&lt;/strong&gt;en achat programmatique, idéalement acquise en agence média.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience avérée dans la gestion de campagnes digitales complexes, avec une forte composante client-facing (élaboration de recommandations, présentations, suivi des relations).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Techniques (Hard Skills) :&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maîtrise approfondie des plateformes d&#39;achat programmatique (indispensable) :&lt;/strong&gt;DV360, The Trade Desk, Amazon Ads, Google Ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyse de données et Reporting :&lt;/strong&gt;Maîtrise avancée d&#39;Excel et de Google Analytics pour analyser les performances, extraire des insights pertinents et construire des bilans clairs et stratégiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connaissance des méthodes de Brand Safety et Ad Verification :&lt;/strong&gt;Une familiarité avec des outils comme IAS est un plus pour garantir la qualité et la sécurité de nos diffusions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stratégie Média Digitale :&lt;/strong&gt;Capacité à élaborer et mettre en œuvre des stratégies d&#39;achat média percutantes, notamment pour des objectifs de branding et de vidéo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Comportementales (Behavioral Competencies) :&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomie &amp;amp; Proactivité :&lt;/strong&gt;Vous êtes capable de gérer votre portefeuille de clients de manière indépendante, d&#39;anticiper les besoins et de proposer des initiatives innovantes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigueur, Organisation &amp;amp; Souci du Détail :&lt;/strong&gt;Essentiels pour garantir la qualité des campagnes, le respect des budgets et l&#39;exactitude des livrables dans un environnement exigeant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orientation Client &amp;amp; Excellent Sens du Service :&lt;/strong&gt;Votre capacité à écouter, comprendre et répondre aux attentes de nos clients fait de vous un partenaire privilégié.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit Collaboratif &amp;amp; Communication :&lt;/strong&gt;Vous savez travailler en équipe, partager vos connaissances et vos feedbacks, et interagir efficacement avec des interlocuteurs variés, y compris des équipes délocalisées.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacité d&#39;Analyse et de Résolution de Problèmes :&lt;/strong&gt;Vous êtes capable de décortiquer des situations complexes pour identifier les leviers d&#39;optimisation et apporter des solutions concrètes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anglais courant indispensable&lt;/strong&gt;, à l&#39;écrit comme à l&#39;oral, pour la gestion de comptes internationaux et la collaboration avec nos équipes globales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;La vie chez WPP Media et ses avantages&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre engagement à façonner l&#39;avenir des médias se manifeste par un soutien actif au développement professionnel de nos talents, les aidant à atteindre leur plein potentiel. Cette démarche s&#39;accompagne d&#39;une vision responsable dans nos stratégies d&#39;investissement médiatique, reflétant ainsi notre double priorité : valoriser nos collaborateurs tout en adoptant des pratiques durables dans notre secteur. Les collaborateurs de WPP Media ont un accès privilégié aux réseaux internationaux de WPP Media et WPP, leur permettant de développer leurs passions, d&#39;étendre leur réseau professionnel et de rester à la pointe des innovations en marketing et publicité. Nous disposons de ressources vastes et variées au service de nos collaborateurs, notre entreprise cultive activement l&#39;inclusion des talents de tous horizons. Les réussites et expertises des équipes sont régulièrement mises en lumière lors d&#39;événements fédérateurs qui ponctuent également les moments clés de l&#39;année, renforçant ainsi notre culture d&#39;entreprise collaborative et diversifiée.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos avantages comprennent :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Télétravail :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Jusqu&#39;à 2 jours par semaine et 2 semaines complètes à prendre en deux fois dans l’année.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deux jours de repos supplémentaires&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;offerts, dont le lundi de Pentecôte.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jours de congé additionnels&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;par palier de 5 ans d’ancienneté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5 jours de télétravail additionnels par mois&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;pour les collaborateurs souffrant d’endométriose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Politique handicap :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;3 jours d&#39;absence autorisés payés par an, accès à des Chèques Emploi Service Universel, et accompagnements spécifiques pour les collaborateurs ayant une RQTH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missions solidaires&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;possibles via le programme We care and we act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Process de recrutement&amp;nbsp;: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien avec l’équipe recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Un premier entretien téléphonique ou par vidéoconférence avec un membre de notre équipe recrutement. Cela nous permettra de mieux connaître vos compétences et votre expérience, et vous donnera l&#39;occasion de poser des questions sur le poste et l&#39;entreprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien opérationnel :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Un entretien en visioconférence avec un Lead de l&#39;équipe et un Manager pour évaluer l&#39;adéquation de vos compétences et de votre profil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étude de cas (Business Case) :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Une étude de cas technique vous sera proposée après l&#39;entretien opérationnel afin d’évaluer vos compétences techniques liées au poste. Vous disposerez de 10 jours pour la réaliser.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien Physique &amp;amp; Restitution du Business Case :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Un entretien physique obligatoire, lors duquel vous présenterez votre Business Case et échangerez avec le manager direct et un autre Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous nous engageons à rendre ce process aussi rapide et efficace que possible, et à maintenir une communication ouverte et transparente tout au long du process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media garantit l&#39;égalité des chances et considère tous les candidats sans discrimination ni considération de caractéristiques particulières. Nous nous engageons à cultiver un environnement de respect où chacun se sent à sa place et bénéficie des mêmes opportunités d&#39;évolution professionnelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consultez notre politique de confidentialité pour tout savoir sur la protection de vos données&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;politique de confidentialité&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bien que nous étudiions toutes les candidatures reçues, nous ne contactons que les personnes sélectionnées pour un entretien.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dans un souci de clarté et d’accessibilité, nous avons choisi de ne pas utiliser l’écriture inclusive dans nos communications. WPP Media est fermement engagé en faveur de la diversité : nous valorisons l&#39;inclusion et l&#39;égalité, en considérant tous les candidats sans distinction d&#39;identité de genre, d&#39;origine ethnique ou de religion. Tous nos postes sont également ouverts aux personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de WPP Media :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP est le partenaire de confiance des plus grandes marques mondiales pour assurer leur croissance.&lt;/strong&gt; Nous réunissons une intelligence média de pointe, une créativité de classe mondiale, une production de nouvelle génération, des solutions pour transformer le marketing à l’ère de l’IA et un conseil stratégique d’expert au sein d’une seule compagnie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propulsés par des talents exceptionnels et WPP Open, notre plateforme de marketing agentique, nous déployons l’IA à grande échelle pour aider nos clients à naviguer dans un monde en pleines mutations et à optimiser leurs investissements marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour plus d’informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;www.wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media est le collectif média global de WPP. Dans un monde où les médias sont omniprésents, nous regroupons la meilleure plateforme, les meilleurs talents et les meilleurs partenaires pour développer les solutions les plus innovantes, offrant une croissance inégalée à nos clients. Pour plus d&#39;informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;https://wppmedia.com/&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez WPP Media, nous croyons en la puissance de notre culture et de nos collaborateurs. C&#39;est grâce à cette synergie que nous parvenons à créer des expériences véritablement exceptionnelles, tant pour nos clients que pour nos équipes internes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour réussir dans ce poste, il est fondamental d&#39;incarner les valeurs essentielles qui unissent WPP et WPP Media :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Être Extraordinaire&lt;/strong&gt; en favorisant un leadership collectif qui inspire une créativité véritablement transformationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Créer un environnement Ouvert&lt;/strong&gt; en trouvant l&#39;équilibre parfait entre l&#39;épanouissement de nos collaborateurs et la satisfaction de nos clients, le tout fondé sur une confiance mutuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diriger avec Optimisme&lt;/strong&gt; en stimulant activement la croissance et le développement pour mobiliser l&#39;ensemble de notre organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rôle et missions :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rattaché au &lt;strong&gt;Head of Social Media&lt;/strong&gt; et en coordination étroite avec le &lt;strong&gt;Head of Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, vous pilotez un portefeuille de clients clés et participez activement au développement de l’agence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous concevez des stratégies de contenu innovantes pour les écosystèmes de nos marques clientes en intégrant les cibles, les nouveaux usages, les plateformes sociales et les enjeux de &lt;em&gt;brand experience&lt;/em&gt;, tant sur le volet éditorial que sur l&#39;influence marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos responsabilités s&#39;articulent autour de 3 grands axes :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Conseil Stratégique &amp;amp; Relation Client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stratégie &amp;amp; Recommandations :&lt;/strong&gt; Écriture et pilotage des recommandations stratégiques Social Media &amp;amp; Influence (fil rouge et temps forts) pour les marques de votre portefeuille ; définition et suivi des KPI de performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soutenance &amp;amp; Restitution :&lt;/strong&gt; Présentation orale des recommandations et des bilans stratégiques auprès des annonceurs, en vous appuyant sur votre équipe et en synergie avec les pôles experts de l’agence (&lt;em&gt;Content Strategy&lt;/em&gt;, Production, Événementiel, Média).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Satisfaction :&lt;/strong&gt; Suivi rigoureux de la relation client, garantie du bon déploiement opérationnel des campagnes, respect des plannings, gestion des budgets et rentabilité financière des projets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Développement Commercial &amp;amp; Offre&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business &amp;amp; Croissance :&lt;/strong&gt; Pilotage des briefs entrants (Inbizz et NewBizz) et participation active au développement du portefeuille clients et du chiffre d&#39;affaires de la Business Unit Studio M.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement de l’offre Influence :&lt;/strong&gt; Contribution à l’enrichissement des méthodologies et outils (GOAT, outils de veille/social listening) et développement des relations avec les créateurs de contenu, agences de management et maisons artistiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Management &amp;amp; Synergies d’Équipe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Management d’équipe :&lt;/strong&gt; Encadrement, formation et montée en compétences de 1 à 3 personnes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation &amp;amp; Process :&lt;/strong&gt; Mise en place des process de collaboration pour accompagner la progression et la fidélisation des talents au sein de l&#39;équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transversalité :&lt;/strong&gt; Développement des synergies au quotidien avec les autres expertises de WPP Media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Profil recherché :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; De formation supérieure (Bac+5 en marketing, communication, médias ou école de commerce), vous justifiez d’au moins &lt;strong&gt;5 ans d’expérience&lt;/strong&gt; en agence (Social Media, média ou globale) sur la gestion de comptes d&#39;envergure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Métier :&lt;/strong&gt; Excellente culture des plateformes sociales, des tendances de contenu, des mécaniques d&#39;activation d&#39;influence et de l&#39;écosystème des créateurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sens Stratégique &amp;amp; Business :&lt;/strong&gt; Fortes capacités d&#39;analyse, d&#39;écriture stratégique et aisance à l&#39;oral pour pitcher devant des directions marketing. Sensibilité financière (gestion de marge, suivi de P&amp;amp;L projet).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership :&lt;/strong&gt; Expérience réussie en management ou tutorat d&#39;équipe, esprit d’écoute, bienveillance et rigueur opérationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise courante de l’anglais (écrit et oral), indispensable dans notre environnement international.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;La vie chez WPP Media et ses avantages :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre engagement à façonner l&#39;avenir des médias se manifeste par un soutien actif au développement professionnel de nos talents, les aidant à atteindre leur plein potentiel. Cette démarche s&#39;accompagne d&#39;une vision responsable dans nos stratégies d&#39;investissement médiatique, reflétant ainsi notre double priorité : valoriser nos collaborateurs tout en adoptant des pratiques durables dans notre secteur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les collaborateurs de WPP Media ont un accès privilégié aux réseaux internationaux de WPP Media et WPP, leur permettant de développer leurs passions, d&#39;étendre leur réseau professionnel et de rester à la pointe des innovations en marketing et publicité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous disposons de ressources vastes et variées au service de nos collaborateurs, notre entreprise cultive activement l&#39;inclusion des talents de tous horizons. Les réussites et expertises des équipes sont régulièrement mises en lumière lors d&#39;événements fédérateurs qui ponctuent également les moments clés de l&#39;année, renforçant ainsi notre culture d&#39;entreprise collaborative et diversifiée.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos avantages comprennent :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Télétravail :&lt;/strong&gt; jusqu&#39;à 2 jours par semaine et 2 semaines complètes à prendre en deux fois dans l’année.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Congés offerts :&lt;/strong&gt; 2 jours de repos supplémentaires offerts, dont le lundi de Pentecôte.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ancienneté :&lt;/strong&gt; Jours de congé additionnels par palier de 5 ans d’ancienneté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Santé &amp;amp; Équité :&lt;/strong&gt; 5 jours de télétravail additionnels par mois pour les collaboratrices souffrant d’endométriose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Politique handicap :&lt;/strong&gt; 3 jours d&#39;absence autorisés payés par an, accès à des Chèques Emploi Service Universel (CESU), et accompagnements spécifiques pour les collaborateurs ayant une RQTH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement sociétal :&lt;/strong&gt; Missions solidaires possibles via le programme &lt;em&gt;We care and we act&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools &amp;amp; Innovation :&lt;/strong&gt; Accès à des outils performants et à la pointe de la technologie pour la gestion des campagnes, l&#39;écoute et le reporting (WPP Open).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Process de recrutement :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous nous engageons à rendre ce process aussi rapide et efficace que possible, et à maintenir une communication ouverte et transparente tout au long du process :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien avec l’équipe Recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt; Un premier échange téléphonique ou par vidéoconférence avec l’équipe Talent pour aborder votre parcours et vos aspirations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien Opérationnel :&lt;/strong&gt; Un échange approfondi avec le manager du poste pour échanger sur vos expériences, la vision du pôle et les enjeux clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étude de cas :&lt;/strong&gt; Une mise en situation concrète (cas pratique stratégique Social Media &amp;amp; Influence) suivie d’une restitution orale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media garantit l&#39;égalité des chances et considère tous les candidats sans discrimination ni considération de caractéristiques particulières. Nous nous engageons à cultiver un environnement de respect où chacun se sent à sa place et bénéficie des mêmes opportunités d&#39;évolution professionnelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consultez notre politique de confidentialité pour tout savoir sur la &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;politique de confidentialité&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bien que nous étudiions toutes les candidatures reçues, nous ne contactons que les personnes sélectionnées pour un entretien.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;#&lt;span class=&quot;markq92avsdst&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbtc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbrc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbbc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsblc=&quot;&quot;&gt;LI&lt;/span&gt;-&lt;span class=&quot;markd2m9d21dp&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbtc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbrc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsbbc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsblc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Technical Account Manager is a technical team member responsible for all aspects of the planning, architecture, coordination, and management of professional services engagements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The focus is on architecting and project management of availability solutions, including data protection and monitoring. The Technical Account manager is an expert in the areas of Data Management, Data Analytics, Business Continuity, Data Center, Cloud, Operating Systems, Networking, Storage, and Virtualization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; remote, France &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;(Work from Home combined with face-to-face customer visits)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide input to the writing of proposals and Statements of Work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support delivery implementation and consulting services to meet Veeam Software solution design and deliverables&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide overall project guidance (Project plans, Schedules, Communication Plans, Resource plans, Status updates, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with assessment and design of solutions&amp;nbsp;as well as post-installation issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with Veeam Software solution implementation effort estimation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create white papers, solutions guides, best practices, custom documentation, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver onsite knowledge transfer on Veeam Software solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document configuration and completed activities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse installed environments and guide optimal Veeam Software configurations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate communication between client and Veeam support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify additional needs within the client’s environment that can be resolved with Veeam Software solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide input for improvement of process and documentation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overnight business stays to meet company goals and objectives, up to 30% travelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VMware VCP, Microsoft MCSE or equivalent experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prince 2, ITIL, PMP,  or equivalent experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree in technology required (A combination of education and experience will be considered)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Veeam’s Core products&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven Consulting and Project Management  experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, interpersonal and relationship-building skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience and understanding of virtualisation technologies such as VMware and Hyper-V&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with disruptive storage systems and technologies (Nimble, Nexsan, Actifio, Veeam, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with networking protocols and equipment (Fibre Channel, Ethernet, Cloud services)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with traditional storage and backup architectures (EMC, NetApp, IBM, HP/3PAR, Hitachi, Dell, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Kubernetes is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Enterprise applications (Exchange, SQL, Oracle, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Data Management, Data Protection, Data Analytics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience with Data Center, Business Continuity and Operating Systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience successfully managing multiple simultaneous projects and accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Cloud technologies, capabilities, and protocols&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business proficient in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13282&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20ce0acc&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days plus &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RTT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; days, plus 4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13425&quot; data-local-id=&quot;42878605&quot;&gt;Mandatory public health insurance with broad medical coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13490&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db28b9e&quot;&gt;Employer-paid private medical, dental, optical, and wellness plan through Axa, with options for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13600&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6db259ba&quot;&gt;Life insurance with enhanced coverage above the Social Security ceiling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13675&quot; data-local-id=&quot;53633940&quot;&gt;State and supplementary pension contributions by Veeam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13733&quot; data-local-id=&quot;19bfbf32&quot;&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;If the applicant is permanently present outside France, Veeam reserves the right to decline consideration of the application for the job. A remote job is only possible in case the employee is located in France.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-JB1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;56095010243a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Veeam Software is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt; and does not tolerate discrimination in any form on the basis of race, color, religion, gender, age, national origin, citizenship, disability, veteran status or any other classification protected by federal, state or local law. All your information will be kept confidential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data collected during the recruitment process will be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.veeam.com/legal/recruiting-privacy-notice.html&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how your information is collected, used, and handled in connection with hiring activities. By applying for this position, you consent to this processing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you confirm that the information provided, including any supporting documents, is complete and accurate to the best of your knowledge. Any misrepresentation, omission, or falsification may result in disqualification from consideration or, if discovered after employment begins, termination of employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;app&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) accelerates digital transformation so customers can be more agile, efficient, resilient, and secure. The Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange platform protects thousands of customers from cyberattacks and data loss by securely connecting users, devices, and applications in any location. Distributed across 200+ public data centers globally and thousands of private sites at the edge, the SASE-based Zero Trust Exchange is the world’s largest in-line cloud security platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the future of work is Human + AI and are building an AI-native enterprise where human potential is amplified by machine intelligence to solve the world’s hardest security challenges. Driven by deep customer obsession, we are committed to the mission, outcome, and to each other. We bring these commitments to life through three core behaviors: ownership and collaboration, trust through outcomes and impact, and a challenge culture with ongoing feedback. Ready to make an impact at the company pioneering security transformation in the AI era? Join us at Zscaler.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive to join our team. This is a Hybrid role, reporting to the Regional Director in the Sales and Go-to-Market department. The Sales and Go-to-Market team is a global group of professionals who are passionate about delighting our customers, nurturing trusted partnerships, and driving a secure, cloud-enabled digital future. In this role, you will focus on expanding our footprint across the French market, demonstrating the power and agility of cloud transformation to enterprise accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage an assigned territory focused on net new logo and upsell opportunities across the French market, mainly covering Public sector accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue growth by selling into Enterprise level accounts (2000-10,000 users)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales Engineering, Solution Architecture, Value Consulting, and Transformation Teams throughout your sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity. You&#39;re comfortable building the path as you walk it. You thrive in a dynamic environment, seeing ambiguity not as a hindrance, but as the raw material to build something meaningful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner. Your passion for the mission fuels your bias for action. You operate with integrity because you genuinely care about the outcome. True ownership involves leveraging dynamic range: the ability to navigate seamlessly between high-level strategy and hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem-solver. You love running towards the challenges because you are laser-focused on finding the solution, knowing that solving the hard problems delivers the biggest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a high-trust collaborator. You are ambitious for the team, not just yourself. You embrace our challenge culture by giving and receiving ongoing feedback—knowing that candor delivered with clarity and respect is the truest form of teamwork and the fastest way to earn trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a learner. You have a true growth mindset and are obsessed with your own development, actively seeking feedback to become a better partner and a stronger teammate. You love what you do and you do it with purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working with enterprise technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of building new logos from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience navigating and selling within the French market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling a complex SaaS solution and leading complex sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI-powered sales intelligence tools or positioning AI-driven cloud security architectures to enterprise clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public Sector experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cyber security experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-FO1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;At Zscaler, we are committed to building a team that reflects the communities we serve and the customers we work with. We foster an inclusive environment that values all backgrounds and perspectives, emphasizing collaboration and belonging. Join us in our mission to make doing business seamless and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Benefits program is one of the most important ways we support our employees. Zscaler proudly offers comprehensive and inclusive benefits to meet the diverse needs of our employees and their families throughout their life stages, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off plans for vacation and sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental leave options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office perks, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;has-nudge&quot; data-nudge-id=&quot;5eb9419b-6a4d-4451-bfa6-e2eb96084be0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Learn more about Zscaler&#39;s hybrid working model and benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zscaler.com/candidate-resource-hub&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this role, you adhere to applicable laws, regulations, and Zscaler policies, including those related to security and privacy standards and guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all individuals. We strive to create a workplace where employees are treated with respect and have the chance to succeed. All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy or related medical conditions), age, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, genetic information, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. &lt;em&gt;See more information by clicking on the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights: Workplace Discrimination is Illegal &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;link.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler complies with all applicable federal, state, and local pay transparency rules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zscaler is committed to providing reasonable support (called accommodations or adjustments) in our recruiting processes for candidates who are differently abled, have long term conditions, mental health conditions or sincerely held religious beliefs, or who are neurodivergent or require pregnancy-related support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll (Working Student)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;About the team&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, our People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll team is the engine behind a smooth and reliable employee experience. We manage the full employee lifecycle — from onboarding and contract changes through to offboarding — while supporting accurate and timely payroll across Southern Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In France, recurring operational work is growing across employee lifecycle administration, field sales hiring and payroll coordination. You’ll join a hands-on, detail-driven team where operational excellence and employee care go hand in hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Working Student position supporting the People Operations &amp;amp; Payroll team in France. You’ll take ownership of recurring administrative and payroll support tasks, help keep our data accurate and up to date, and make sure employees and managers get timely, clear support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a great entry point into HR and payroll operations for someone who is organised, reliable, and eager to build real expertise in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Payroll support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to collect, and organise payroll input data ahead of monthly deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support follow-up with external payroll and benefits providers where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain accurate payroll records and flag missing information or discrepancies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HR administration &amp;amp; employee lifecycle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare, update, and archive employment contracts and employee documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding, contract changes, and offboarding processes — ensuring data accuracy and completeness at every step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with benefits administration where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employee support &amp;amp; ticket handling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to routine employee and manager queries via internal systems and email with clarity and care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage open tickets and follow up, escalating more complex cases when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data management &amp;amp; process improvement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update employee data in HR systems and Excel / Google Sheets trackers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform regular data checks and keep Notion pages and internal documentation up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify repetitive steps, data-quality issues, or bottlenecks in recurring workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggest small process improvements that make day-to-day operations more efficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying or recently graduated in HR, Business Administration, Economics, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English — clear written and verbal communication is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and a commitment to accuracy, especially with sensitive employee and payroll data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic Excel / Google Sheets skills and confidence working with structured data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and reliable — able to manage recurring tasks and meet regular deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable handling confidential information with discretion and good judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick to learn new tools and systems — we work across multiple HR platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player with a hands-on, service-oriented attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Previous experience or studies in HR, payroll administration, or people operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Interest in payroll processes, HR systems, or process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Familiarity with AI tools such as ChatGPT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why SumUp?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎&amp;nbsp; Work with a truly global, multicultural team from our Barcelona office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈&amp;nbsp; Be part of a workplace that values diversity and inclusion, where every perspective is respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;❤️&amp;nbsp; Access our Employee Assistance Programme for mental health guidance and support when you need it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;En bref&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prêt(e) à piloter l’excellence du service client chez Picnic ? Dans une équipe constituée de 3 autres Superviseurs et sous la responsabilité de nos Managers des Opérations, tu encadres une équipe de 25 Chargé(e)s de clientèle et tu assures la fluidité de nos opérations sur tous nos canaux. Entre coaching, résolution de cas complexes et collaboration étroite avec les équipes en entrepôts, ton impact est immédiat. Une fois le quotidien maîtrisé, tu prends les commandes de projets transverses pour optimiser nos processus et réinventer l’expérience client. Tu veux passer à la vitesse supérieure ? Envoie-nous ton CV et rencontrons-nous !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tes missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encadrement des Chargé(e)s de clientèle&lt;/strong&gt; : Recruter, former et encadrer une équipe diversifiée d’agents du service client pour garantir un service de qualité;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pilotage opérationnel quotidien&lt;/strong&gt; : Assurer la fluidité du service sur tous nos canaux (WhatsApp, e-mails, appels), tout en garantissant un bon suivi des KPIs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion de crise &lt;/strong&gt;: Être le/la premier(e) interlocuteur(rice) sur les cas complexes, tu coordonnes les solutions avec les entrepôts pour transformer chaque incident en succès client;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exécution de projets d&#39;amélioration&lt;/strong&gt; : Mener à bien des projets pour optimiser les performances de l&#39;équipe;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimisation continue&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu analyses les retours terrains pour améliorer nos processus internes et l&#39;ergonomie de notre application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour assurer une présence continue à nos clients tout en préservant ton équilibre, ton planning s’articule autour de trois rythmes :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shifts opérationnels&lt;/strong&gt; : Soit au bureau de &lt;strong&gt;8h à 16h&lt;/strong&gt;, soit en télétravail de &lt;strong&gt;15h à 23h&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shifts projets&lt;/strong&gt; : Des journées au bureau de &lt;strong&gt;10h à 18h&lt;/strong&gt; pour te concentrer sur l&#39;amélioration de nos services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La présence week-end &lt;/strong&gt;: Tu assures &lt;strong&gt;3&amp;nbsp;week-ends&lt;/strong&gt; par mois, intégralement en &lt;strong&gt;télétravail&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;À propos de toi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es titulaire au minimum d&#39;un diplôme de niveau Bac +2 en relation client, management ou autre domaine équivalent ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu disposes d&#39;une expérience de 1 à 3 ans en management d&#39;équipes opérationnelles, de préférence en service client ou autre domaine similaire ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises le français et l&#39;anglais de sorte à pouvoir t’impliquer dans des projets d’envergure internationale ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;En cas d’urgence, tu gardes ton sang-froid et gères les priorités efficacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Avantages Picnic&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍴 &lt;strong&gt;Restauration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comme nous sommes implantés au centre de Paris, pas de cantine sur place. Par contre, des tickets restaurant d’une valeur de 11€ par jour sont remis afin de tester tous les délicieux restaurants du coin. Notre petite cuisine est également équipée de savoureux en-cas et rafraîchissements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎫Sorties et divertissement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Profite d&#39;un accès à des offres et avantages exclusifs via notre CSE et partenaire Swile (bons d&#39;achat, places de concert, cinéma, et plus encore). Tu profiteras aussi d&#39;inviations à tous nos événements récurrents comme notre très convoitée Summer Party !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚲 &lt;strong&gt;Santé et transports&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grâce à nos partenariats avec SideCare et OpenUp, tu as la possibilité de souscrire à notre mutuelle d’entreprise ainsi qu’à un accès facile et gratuit à des psychologues professionnels, des ateliers et des outils pratiques. De plus, si tu te rends au travail en transports en commun, nous te remboursons ton abonnement à hauteur de 50%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✍️ &lt;strong&gt;Développement personnel et professionnel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu auras l’opportunité de développer tes compétences, non seulement au travers de projets stimulants, mais aussi grâce à un environnement dynamique, jeune et international.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour en apprendre davantage sur Picnic, rends-toi sur notre page&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Welcome to the Jungle&lt;/em&gt; en cliquant&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.welcometothejungle.com/fr/companies/picnic&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;ici&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/IkZNKGYreOU&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm that transforms organizations through data and AI. With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. From our Lausanne and Zurich offices, we help leading Swiss and international companies turn data and AI into measurable results, working with the leading data platforms, including Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will design and deliver the data platforms our clients run their business and their AI on, combining hands-on engineering with client advisory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build modern data platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; End-to-end lakehouse architectures, mainly on Databricks, built for reliability, observability, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineer pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt; Batch and streaming pipelines with Python, Spark, and SQL, with data quality built in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Migrate and modernize:&lt;/strong&gt; Move legacy warehouses and ETL to the cloud, from assessment to cut-over.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make data ready for AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Governed data products and semantic layers that analytics and AI agents can rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run it properly:&lt;/strong&gt; Data governance, CI/CD, infrastructure as code, monitoring, and cost control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advise and support:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate business needs into roadmaps, coach junior engineers, and support proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Engineer first, consultant second, with a track record of shipping to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in data engineering, including hands-on Databricks experience in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert Python and SQL, with strong Spark and data modeling skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Data Engineer Professional certification, or a commitment to obtain it within 6 months (we support you).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience on Azure, AWS, or GCP, plus DataOps (Git, CI/CD, Terraform, testing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consulting skills: requirements gathering, documentation, stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English plus French or German (both is a plus); eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with other data platforms (Snowflake, Microsoft Fabric, BigQuery), dbt, MLOps, and industry experience (consumer goods, pharma, logistics, insurance, manufacturing).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Build the platforms behind boardroom priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Swiss Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; High visibility from day one on flagship programs, working directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Tech Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Certified peers across Artefact and close partnerships with leading data and cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Certifications, training, international missions, and a team of doers who move fast and support each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the criteria, we still want to hear from you. Tell us about your passion, curiosity, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe that privacy is a fundamental human right and the cornerstone of democracy. Since our inception in 2014, founded by a team of scientists from CERN, we have dedicated ourselves to providing free and open-source technology to millions worldwide, ensuring access to privacy, security, and freedom online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our journey began with Proton Mail, the largest secure email service globally, and has since expanded to include Proton VPN, Proton Calendar, Proton Drive, and Proton Pass. These tools empower individuals and organizations to take control of their personal data, break away from Big Tech’s invasive practices, and defeat censorship. Our work impacts hundreds of millions of lives, from activists on the front lines defending freedom to leaders in governments protecting sensitive information. In some cases, Proton’s services have even been instrumental in saving lives by enabling secure and private communications in high-risk situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proton today supports over 100 million user accounts with a growing team of over 500 people from over 50 different countries, from the world&#39;s top companies and universities. We value intelligence, learning potential, and ambition in our hiring process. Adaptability is key as we navigate uncharted territories and redefine how business is conducted online. We believe smaller teams of exceptional talent will always prevail over larger teams with lower talent density. Proton has become profitable and reached scale without relying upon VC funding, largely due to superior talent that allows us to do things faster, more creatively, and more efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global mindset and big ambitions but remain a start-up at heart. We value empowerment and flexibility and keep our structure flat to keep moving fast and avoid unnecessary politics. Tired of blending into the crowd? Join us and do work you can truly be proud of.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXP96911575 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXP96911575 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;inline-comment-marker&quot; data-ref=&quot;df41d9b1-a4e5-469e-b94c-9c31cb38a786&quot;&gt;Check our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;social media pages&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more about us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://x.com/ProtonPrivacy&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/ProtonMail/&quot;&gt;Reddit&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/protonprivacy/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive to drive new B2B business for Proton in Switzerland. You will own the full sales cycle, from identifying and qualifying opportunities to negotiating and closing deals. You will build relationships with senior decision-makers, develop strategic partnerships across the Swiss business and public-sector ecosystems, and help grow Proton&#39;s presence in its home market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Creation &amp;amp; Strategic Opportunity Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify and develop new strategic opportunities across target segments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Build and manage your own pipeline of high-quality opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Balance long-term opportunity creation with closing deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify, engage, and develop partnerships with corporates, industry bodies, service providers and ecosystem partners (including co-selling opportunities)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Development (Switzerland Focus)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Leverage your existing network within Swiss corporates and organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Expand Proton&#39;s presence within local business and public-sector ecosystems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify high-value entry points into target companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Build strong relationships with senior stakeholders (IT, security, leadership)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Act as a trusted advisor and entry point into organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Navigate complex organizational structures to identify opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Sales Cycle Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Own the full sales cycle, from first contact to signed contract&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Identify and qualify opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Run discovery to understand use case, stakeholders and potential deal scope&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Negotiate and close deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Work closely with Sales leadership to align on target segments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Provide feedback on market opportunities and ICP evolution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Share insights from partnerships and market interactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Lexical__textBold&quot;&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• 3–7 years in Account Executive, Business Development or Strategic Sales roles, owning the full sales cycle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Proven experience selling in the Swiss market (required)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Experience in B2B SaaS or technology environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Proven track record of generating pipeline and closing deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong existing network within Swiss companies and/or public-sector ecosystems (highly preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Appetite to develop and grow a network of Swiss customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong relationship-building and networking capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Ability to identify and develop strategic opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong negotiation and closing skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strong communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Comfortable operating without a structured playbook&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Fluent in Swiss German and English &lt;strong&gt;(required)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• French is a strong plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Hunter mindset focused on opportunity creation and closing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Strategic thinker with strong commercial instincts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Proactive, self-driven, and comfortable operating in ambiguity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Long-term relationship builder&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;Lexical__paragraph&quot;&gt;• Geneva, Zurich or remotely within Switzerland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We provide all the devices and software you need to excel in your role, ensuring you have the best tools at your disposal to achieve your goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lunch and snacks are provided by Proton every day at our offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We will always support our employees with transport costs through subsidizing public transport, bike allowances, or parking spaces based on your office location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;At Proton, we are all owners of the company and you get stock options when you join us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You can define your own working hours as long as it works with team meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are committed to your professional growth. Proton offers various learning opportunities, including training programs, conferences and events, and continual learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive health insurance plans, competitive retirement savings options, generous vacation and leave policies, and wellness programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proton is a community-first organization, started with the support of a crowdfunding campaign and built with community input. To this day, Proton’s only source of revenue is user subscriptions. Over 100 million people trust and support Proton, and we put our users and community first in everything we do. Read more about our impact&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://proton.me/impact&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check our social media to learn more about Proton:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/protonprivacy/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.reddit.com/r/ProtonMail/&quot;&gt;Reddit&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://x.com/intent/user?screen_name=ProtonPrivacy&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@ProtonAG&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you apply for a position, refer a candidate, or are considered for a role at Proton Technologies AG (Proton, we, us, or our), your information is stored in Greenhouse, in accordance with their&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Service Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;This information is used to evaluate your suitability for the posted position. We also retain this information for consideration for future roles that you may apply for or that we believe may align with your background and skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will either delete or anonymize it. Should you have any inquiries about how we use or manage your information, or if you wish to access, correct, or delete your data, please contact our privacy team at -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited resumes from any sources other than directly from candidates. We will not pay a fee for any placement resulting from an unsolicited offer, even if the candidate is subsequently hired by Proton.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To learn more about our privacy policy, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://boards.eu.greenhouse.io/protongdpr&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;our privacy policy page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LinkedIn-Onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Autonomous Drone Software Engineer to join a swarming programme. As an engineer on a lean, high-impact team, you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be siloed; this role spans the entire autonomy lifecycle, from developing autonomy capabilities to investigating real-world flight-test data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across the autonomy stack and partner integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with hardware engineers, product managers, and external partners to define system requirements and translate them into robust software architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust distributed state machines, leader election protocols, and fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code while confidently managing complex concurrency and contention scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run rigorous tests utilizing SITL/HITL simulation environments to validate code prior to physical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in code reviews, architectural discussions, and technical documentation to elevate the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act decisively during flight-test investigations, applying strong engineering judgment to physical failure modes and release safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional engineering experience in robotics, embedded systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern C++, with practical experience designing, reasoning about, and debugging highly concurrent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded systems experience working close to hardware on real-time or safety-critical platforms (e.g., avionics, automotive, robotics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural understanding of distributed systems, with the ability to deliberately evaluate and select consensus designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust release management, versioned artifacts, and pinned dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, MAVLink, and related drone software ecosystems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CoLab&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoLab, we help mechanical engineering teams bring life-changing products to market years sooner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build AI for engineers designing cars, medical devices, and jet engines. Products this complex aren&#39;t sketched and sent to production. Teams spend months on iterations, reviews, and tests, predicting how every part performs before anything is built. CoLab is where those reviews happen, and we capture the rationale behind every change. Other tools show what changed between versions. Only CoLab knows why. That&#39;s how our AI helps manufacturers like Bobcat, Triumph Motorcycles, and GE Appliances make better decisions, eliminate rework cycles, and get to market faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proudly based in St. John’s, Newfoundland, CoLab started with one customer in 2018. Since then we’ve raised a&lt;a href=&quot;https://financialpost.com/pmn/business-wire-news-releases-pmn/ai-is-changing-engineering-colab-just-raised-72m-to-lead-the-transformation&quot;&gt; $72M Series C&lt;/a&gt;, been named the 57th fastest growing company in North America by Deloitte (&lt;a href=&quot;https://financialpost.com/pmn/business-wire-news-releases-pmn/colab-ranked-number-57-fastest-growing-company-in-north-america-on-the-2025-deloitte-technology-fast-500&quot;&gt;Fast 500™&lt;/a&gt;), signed multi-year&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theglobeandmail.com/business/article-bombardier-signs-contract-colab-ai-software/&quot;&gt; AI partnerships with companies like Bombardier&lt;/a&gt;, and grown to a team of 250+.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role that helps define how CoLab delivers technical value to its most strategic customers in Aerospace and Defence. CoLab is a category-creating product, which means adoption isn&#39;t just a rollout. It&#39;s a change in how the organization works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;d act as a trusted advisor, leveraging people, process, and technology to help teams rethink how they manage feedback, data, and decision-making across design and PLM. That means getting deep into customer workflows, testing new ways of working, and building repeatable methods the rest of the team can scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside a Customer Success Manager, and use what you learn on the front line to help shape product direction. This role isn&#39;t about selling or pitching. It&#39;s about deeply understanding engineering problems and solving them alongside the customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a candidate in Switzerland to work regularly on-site with local CoLab customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Ideal Candidate&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a mechanical engineer by trade and have worked as a designer in an A&amp;amp;D company. You also understand the full product development life cycle: how design, manufacturing, quality, and engineering leadership depend on each other, and where collaboration breaks down. You can coach those teams toward working together better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You know how to improve that life cycle with technology. Maybe you’ve championed internal tools or created automation or scripts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You also know a process that makes sense on paper won’t get adopted on its own. You can meet people where they are, including the stakeholders who don’t want to change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need to be the loudest voice in the room, but you can run a sprint and lead a cross-functional project. If the average person might find this job too undefined or complex, that probably excites you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mapping a customer&#39;s current-state design review and engineering workflows, and defining the target-state process their teams will actually adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploying and tuning CoLab&#39;s AI capabilities against a customer&#39;s own standards, drawing checklists, and design guidelines, and diagnosing what&#39;s working and what isn&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing mechanical engineering expertise to validate AI-generated results and ensure engineering rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating and solving complex engineering data and integration challenges across PLM, ERP, QMS, and traditional design feedback tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expanding adoption into new teams, programs, and sites within the account, partnering with the Customer Success Manager on where the next opportunity sits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with product teams to identify feature gaps, improve capabilities, and refine AutoReview.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in mechanical design engineering, ideally in a medium- to large-sized organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of PLM &amp;amp; ERP systems and enterprise engineering data architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead technical projects and cross-functional collaborations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with customers or internal stakeholders to solve technical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in fast-changing, ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication and documentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of high-level AI architecture, specifically LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with APIs, data integrations, and enterprise architecture concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Located in Switzerland&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with internal tool development, scripting, or automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI/ML tools applied to engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work in design consulting or product development at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this is a fully remote role, travel is a consistent part of the job. There are two primary types of travel you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Weeks:&lt;/strong&gt; Once per quarter, the sales team or entire company gets together in person. These typically involve traveling out on a Monday and returning on a Thursday or Friday. Two of these each year are held at our headquarters in St. John&#39;s, Newfoundland, Canada and the others take place in more central locations that evolve as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-sites:&lt;/strong&gt; This role will work closely with a local customer with expectations to be on site with that customer, so there will likely be far less travel than our typical MFDE roll. That being said, in the event the local customer were to no longer work with us, the following is our standard MFDE travel expectations: “For most of our large deployment customers, we will visit on-site during kick-off and key expansion opportunities. Most on-sites involve 2-3 days with the customer, with travel on either side. Travel is primarily within North America, and you can expect 4 customer on-sites per quarter.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Extra Details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a full-time, permanent position with a competitive compensation package that includes stock options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid vacation and extended health benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equity Note&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Frequently cited statistics show that people who identify with historically marginalized groups are likely to apply to jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. We encourage you to help us break that statistic and apply even if you don&#39;t meet every single qualification. Your potential is what matters most to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr Director, Head of Quality &amp;amp; Responsible Person, International, leads quality for infigratinib, and will be the designated Responsible Person on the entity&#39;s wholesale distribution authorisation. The role reports to the Head of Quality, QED, with a dotted line to local managing director, and is based in the Netherlands. If the entity becomes the marketing authorisation holder for infigratinib, the role also covers the related MAH quality duties. The role holds an unrestricted right of escalation to the entity&#39;s full board and is independent of commercial operations and of manufacturing/supply with EU-GDP guidelines, relevant EU directives (including the Falsified Medicines Directive), Dutch Medicines Act, and public service requirements. This role acts as a QA liaison of BridgeBio&#39;s contract service providers (CSPs), providing oversight of lot release activities. This role includes reviewing and approving batch records, certificates of analysis, and compliance documents, providing quality review of deviations, change controls, and CAPAs related to assigned CSPs, collaborating closely with CSPs and internal teams such as quality control, manufacturing, regulatory affairs, and supply chain. The role builds and leads a small quality team (deputy RP, QA compliance/QMS, QA operations/GDP), owns the quality management system across the Skeletal Dysplasia assets, and leads WDA licensing, inspection readiness and potentially subsequent MIA readiness, if needed in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Major Responsibilities / Accountabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the named Responsible Person on the WDA: release for distribution, recall decisions, and GDP compliance of the entity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads and develops the entity&#39;s quality team: deputy RP, QA compliance/QMS, and QA operations/GDP; and QP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages and improves the Quality Management System (QMS) across the entity&#39;s assets in alignment with the established QMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the WDA application and IGJ inspection readiness; prepare subsequent MIA readiness (QP recruitment, import and batch-certification processes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the quality agreement matrix: includes Quality oversight of contract service providers, 3PLs, distributors and intercompany interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a Quality liaison and provide oversight and quality support of assigned contract service providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quality review of assigned quality events such as deviations, change controls, supplier notifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review master manufacturing batch records, including related documents such as specifications, analytical and microbiological methods, stability study protocols, and label proofs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage lot release activities and communication of lot release schedules to key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate manufacturing deficiencies/non-conformances to management and work with CSPs to ensure timely resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review process and method validation protocols and reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review analytical test results to ensure compliance with approved specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in updating CMC sections of regulatory and quality documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in internal and external project team meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other QA/Responsible Person related responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accuracy of quality of records per GDP requirements including GDPs are implemented and maintained in the quality management system requirements for WDA license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and coordinate return, rejected, falsified products, recall operations of medicinal products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide oversight of GDP and GMP activities of active pharmaceutical ingredients (API)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure WDA and API registration is current with commercial supply chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and leads EU/ROW regulatory inspections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate and oversee GMP vendor qualification program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the EU/ROW internal audit program, internal training program and ensure data integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and review governing procedures as needed (e.g., SOPs, WIs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Where You’ll Work&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a Netherlands based remote role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel 30% of time is expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who you are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS degree preferably in operations, science, pharmacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diploma, certificate, or other evidence of formal qualifications on completion of GDP/GDP-API training required for registration as an RP by the competent authorities in the Netherlands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in pharmaceutical quality, including significant GDP / distribution quality experience; prior appointment as (or eligibility to be) a Responsible Person strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading regulatory inspections with EU competent authorities (IGJ preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience of managing third party vendors (CMOs, CTLs, 3PLs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior relevant knowledge and experience related to the distribution of medical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of supply chain concepts, supplier management, inventory management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of US/EU GMPs /GDPs and associated guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in a highly regulated environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership of quality teams; experience building quality functions or systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the EU and particularly IGJ regulations in relation to the wholesale distribution of medicines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong planning and time management skills with ability to prioritize workload&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with keen attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in document and presentation office tools (Microsoft Office, Google Docs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of data concepts and enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems e.g., SAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ready to embrace company core values and diverse corporate culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rewarding Those Who Make the Mission Possible&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market leading compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work model - we value your flexibility in how you work, but encourage time in the office to strengthen our culture, collaboration, and sense of community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We provide career development through regular feedback, continuous education and professional development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We celebrate strong performance with financial rewards, peer-to-peer recognition, and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a global company, our comprehensive benefits may vary based on location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For BridgeBio Full-Time U.S Based Roles:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Rewards&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Market-leading compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
