&lt;div&gt;Design and implement deterministic real-time platform software on Embedded Linux using&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;C++17/20 for ARM and x86 architectures&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop low-level drivers for EtherCAT and serial protocols as part of a deterministic control&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;platform supporting model-based control and learning policies&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop firmware for EtherCAT-based robotic devices&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
