&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Optimize real-time system performance using PREEMPT_RT, CPU isolation, scheduler&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;policies, and priority tuning&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
