&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and ship new logistics capabilities&lt;/strong&gt; that directly improve our customer, merchant and rider propositions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
