&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own product goals from inception to delivery&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborating across disciplines to ensure we ship high-quality, high-impact solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
