&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment&lt;/strong&gt; with Finance, Legal, and Strategy &amp;amp; Operations teams globally to bring new features to market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
