&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant experience being data-savvy and analytical&lt;/strong&gt;; you can grasp technical concepts quickly and partner effectively with Machine Learning and Operations Research specialists.&lt;/p&gt;
