&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4279&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aa89bb81a3a4&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 40 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located. Currently,&amp;nbsp;we do allow a hybrid work schedule but we regularly revisit our attendance policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re searching a &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to execute Verifone’s marketing strategy in France and play a pivotal role in accelerating our growth in one of Europe’s most dynamic payments markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Marketing Manager, you’ll be the engine behind France’s marketing performance: building the systems, dashboards, and processes that power smarter decisions, stronger campaigns, and measurable commercial impact. You’ll lead both day‑to‑day execution and long‑term strategy, ensuring our brand, messaging, and demand generation efforts land with precision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the full marketing funnel - from awareness and acquisition to retention and installed‑base growth and you’ll bring hands‑on expertise in marketing automation, lead nurturing, and multi‑channel campaign orchestration. Email, digital, content, events… you know how to blend them into high‑performing programs that generate qualified leads and fuel sales momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries clear accountability: hitting France’s lead targets, elevating lead quality and conversion, enriching data, automating processes, and delivering sharp reporting across programs and channels. Your work will directly influence pipeline, performance, and ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, manage and implement marketing programs and strategies for Verifone France and Paybox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and update the Verifone Regional websites (Including Paybox): website maintenance, supervising the creation and development of websites, including creating specification documents to improve the website and other online projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the advertising campaigns and the relationship with the agency, including creating lists of keywords that define campaigns, creating and testing ads/banners specific for targeted verticals, set-up and monitor end to end lead tracking (sources/channels)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsess about results: analyze site traffic and website flows, conversion optimization campaign results, analyze and report program performance; report metrics appropriately and flag issues for internal stakeholders, provide recommendations for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose new marketing strategies and implement new ideas that can improve overall funnel performance, from brand awareness to client retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and manage email nurture flows and/or drip programs for both prospects and existing customers to support sales growth and retention, and implement the tracking of these flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with multiple teams for developing an effective strategy and new programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience We Desire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native French speaker with advanced English proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in marketing, business, or a related field, with strong foundations in modern digital marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience leading integrated, multi‑channel marketing campaigns across digital, content, email, and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands‑on mastery of key platforms, including &lt;span data-url=&quot;ca://s?q=Explain_marketing_automation_tools&quot;&gt;marketing automation tools&lt;/span&gt; (Pardot, Marketo, etc.), &lt;span data-url=&quot;ca://s?q=What_is_a_CRM_and_how_is_it_used&quot;&gt;CRMs&lt;/span&gt; such as Salesforce or Pipedrive, Google Analytics, social platforms (Facebook, Instagram), and email marketing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical capability to manage complex lead lifecycles, optimize funnel performance, and extract insights from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills to coordinate cross‑functional initiatives and deliver high‑impact marketing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up‑to‑date knowledge of industry trends, emerging technologies, and modern marketing best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SEM‑focused copywriting skills to craft compelling, conversion‑driven search content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of HTML for landing page and email optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert‑level Excel skills, including large dataset handling and macro‑based automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in suggesting new concepts/ideas, self-motivated, fast learner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-oriented and problem-solving attitude (use analytical and creative thinking to find solutions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented, great attention to detail, openness to testing and analyzing large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: ability to cooperate and work fairly with others, at all levels, within and outside the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple projects and work under tight deadlines when necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain tool uptime and ensure excellent execution of installation and support of hardware issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, maintain, and ensure the relevance of technical information used by internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and build long-term innovative global technology systems that enable enhanced customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure communication vehicles, e.g. telephone, email, and presentation, etc. are able to facilitate efficient and consistent customer follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement of the customer experience through team, hardware, software, and support tool development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and manage new product installs and subsequent hardware development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects manage new evaluations and ensure the success of the project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional assigned tasks when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business travel is required when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in building collaborative partnerships with customers and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a team environment with tight deadlines and multiple priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English language fluency is required as you will be working with international clients and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ASM is an equal opportunity employer and considers qualified applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, nationality, social or ethnic origin, sexual orientation, gender, gender identify or expression, marital status, pregnancy, political affiliation, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez &lt;strong&gt;VML&lt;/strong&gt;, nous croyons que les grandes idées naissent quand les talents peuvent être pleinement eux-mêmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Née en 2024 de la fusion de &lt;strong&gt;Wunderman Thompson&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;VMLY&amp;amp;R&lt;/strong&gt;, deux agences parmi les plus créatives et primées au monde, VML est aujourd’hui une agence internationale de référence, au croisement de la &lt;strong&gt;créativité&lt;/strong&gt;, de la &lt;strong&gt;technologie&lt;/strong&gt; et de la &lt;strong&gt;data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propulsée dans le TOP 5 des agences créatives aux Cannes Lions 2025, et réitérant cette performance en se classant dans le TOP 4 aux derniers Cannes Lions 2026, VML a aussi été récompensée dans toutes les compétitions majeures cette année. Leader reconnu sur l’IA, et en forte croissance sur toutes nos expertises, nous sommes auréolés depuis le 1er janvier 2026 du titre d’&lt;strong&gt;Agence de Communication Intégrée de l&#39;Année&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre force ? Une approche intégrée qui réunit &lt;strong&gt;Brand Experience (BX)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Customer Experience (CX)&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;Commerce (CO)&lt;/strong&gt; pour concevoir des expériences de marque uniques, impactantes et durables - pour les consommateurs comme pour les marques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML a également lancé &lt;strong&gt;VML Consulting&lt;/strong&gt; en 2025 (&lt;em&gt;désormais &lt;strong&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;), une entité spécialisée dans la transformation des entreprises centrée sur le client. Cette initiative stratégique qui a fait suite à l&#39;intégration réussie de Velvet Consulting, cabinet de conseil reconnu. &lt;strong&gt;VML Consulting&lt;/strong&gt; incarne la dimension conseil du groupe et fédère, à l’échelle internationale, l’ensemble des &lt;strong&gt;expertises technologiques et data&lt;/strong&gt; de VML.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avec &lt;strong&gt;plus de 30 000 talents dans le monde&lt;/strong&gt;, dont plus de &lt;strong&gt;500 en France répartis entre Paris &amp;amp; Toulouse&lt;/strong&gt;, VML est avant tout une communauté de profils passionnés : créatifs, stratèges, designers, développeurs, experts data, social media, influence, gaming, IA, CRM, e-commerce… Des expertises diverses, une même envie : &lt;strong&gt;imaginer ce qui fait avancer les marques et les usages&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travailler chez VML, c’est :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-évoluer dans un environnement &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;collaboratif et pluridisciplinaire&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-apprendre en continu sur des projets ambitieux et internationaux,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;-contribuer à des campagnes reconnues et primées (&lt;strong&gt;Cannes Lions, Effie Awards, Grand Prix Stratégies…&lt;/strong&gt;),&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;et faire partie d’une agence élue&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Agence de Communication Intégrée de l’Année&lt;/strong&gt; en 2022, 2023 et 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre culture&lt;/strong&gt; repose sur la passion, l’audace créative, l’ouverture et une obsession de l’innovation — avec la conviction que la performance durable commence toujours par les talents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Envie de grandir, d’apprendre et de créer avec nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rejoignez l’aventure VML !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons notre futur(e) &lt;strong&gt;Stagiaire Planning Stratégique Social&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;au sein d&#39;une équipe dédié à un client international prestigieux. Au carrefour de la data, de la culture digitale et de la stratégie de marque, tu décrypteras ce que disent les communautés pour transformer les conversations en insights actionnables, en recommandations percutantes et en briefs créatifs inspirants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Démarrage&lt;/strong&gt; : Janvier 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tes missions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Social Listening, Veille &amp;amp; Intelligence Culturelle&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitorer et analyser les conversations en ligne via nos outils de social listening sur nos marques, nos concurrents et nos industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Décrypter les tendances émergentes (TikTok, Reels, formats vidéo, mèmes, communautés de niche) et identifier les opportunités de &lt;em&gt;newsjacking&lt;/em&gt; ou de prise de parole rapide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger des rapports de veille et d’écoute synthétiques et visuels qui donnent du sens à la data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Planning Stratégique &amp;amp; Recommandations&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à l’élaboration des recommandations stratégiques (idées, activations, calendriers éditoriaux).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger des briefs d’action social media : angles d’attaque, tone of voice, formats prioritaires, KPIs attendus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nourrir les équipes en insights culturels et comportementaux frais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Suivi de Production (Touche-à-tout)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider à la déclinaison et au suivi de production des assets de contenu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre la main à la pâte : tester des formats, prototyper des idées et soutenir l’équipe opérationnelle au besoin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Lab IA &amp;amp; Innovation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utiliser et tester activement les outils d’IA générative pour accélérer la recherche, l’analyse et l’idéation créative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Ton profil&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation :&lt;/strong&gt; Bac+4/5 (École de communication, commerce, IEP, CELSA ou Master spécialisé) à la recherche d’un stage de césure ou de fin d&#39;études.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Internet &amp;amp; Social Native :&lt;/strong&gt; Une passion réelle pour l&#39;écosystème digital et les usages de communautés (TikTok, Instagram, X, Reddit, Discord).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacité d’analyse &amp;amp; d’insight :&lt;/strong&gt; Aptitude à transformer de la data brute et du bruit conversationnel en angles stratégiques exploitables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aisance rédactionnelle &amp;amp; Storytelling :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu as une belle plume, l’esprit de synthèse et le sens du design de présentations (Google Slides, PowerPoint, Keynote).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agilité IA :&lt;/strong&gt; Curieux(se) et déjà utilisateur(trice) d&#39;outils d’IA générative au quotidien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environnement international&lt;/strong&gt; : Aisance professionnelle en anglais, à l&#39;écrit comme à l&#39;oral, pour analyser des conversations mondiales, concevoir des présentations et échanger avec les équipes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1l4u08w&quot; data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;977&quot;&gt;About Constructor&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;979&quot; data-end=&quot;1260&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://constructor.org/&quot;&gt;Constructor&lt;/a&gt; is an international ecosystem spanning education, research, and technology. It includes &lt;a href=&quot;https://constructor.university/&quot;&gt;Constructor University Bremen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a&gt;Constructor Tech&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://constructor.org/knowledge&quot;&gt;Constructor Knowledge&lt;/a&gt;, and partner entities such as EBAC, working together to advance how knowledge is created, taught, and applied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1262&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://constructor.org/knowledge&quot;&gt;Constructor Knowledge&lt;/a&gt; sits at the heart of this ecosystem — connecting students, faculty, partners, media, and industry across our entities and programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a hands on Senior Marketing Manager to own campaign strategy and execution across our multi channel, multi platform marketing operations. This is not a strategy only or purely managerial role; we need someone who can plan a campaign from scratch, build the tracking and data infrastructure behind it, and execute alongside the team. Strong technical fluency, structured thinking, and a bias toward doing over discussing are essential, along with the confidence to present campaign strategies and budgets to stakeholders and defend them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Strategy &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build multi channel, multi platform campaign and marketing plans from the ground up: audience, budget, channel mix, creative direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute hands on across performance channels (Google, Meta, LinkedIn, TikTok, etc.), not just oversee execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run and interpret A/B tests, budget allocation, and continuous optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and adapt campaigns across international markets, different countries, audiences, and budgets, spanning both B2B and B2C contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Data Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and maintain campaign tracking (pixels, UTMs, attribution) across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to building data warehouse / reporting infrastructure for campaign and budget analytics across channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own reporting dashboards and translate data into clear, actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative &amp;amp; Brand&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a strong eye for design; able to produce basic ad creatives independently, not just brief a designer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure creative and messaging consistency across campaigns and channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and take ownership of campaign plans and marketing initiatives with minimal oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a wide range of requesters and stakeholders: management, design, CRM, website, PR, events, and student recruitment teams, among others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt quickly to shifting priorities typical of a startup or scale up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in performance marketing / campaign management, ideally with agency experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated hands on technical skill: platforms management (Google, Meta, LinkedIn, TikTok, etc.), tracking setup, analytics, data infrastructure for campaign reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in startups or small, fast-moving teams; comfortable with ambiguity and multitasking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running international campaigns across multiple countries/continents simultaneously, and working in a multicultural, cross-country team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong structured, analytical mindset; execution oriented over purely conceptual&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic creative production skills (Canva, CapCut, Figma, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven learner who stays current on marketing technology and industry trends independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;moji85&quot; data-start=&quot;5656&quot; data-end=&quot;5672&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;5674&quot; data-end=&quot;5985&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s0didp&quot; data-start=&quot;5734&quot; data-end=&quot;5835&quot;&gt;A central role in a growing international ecosystem connecting education, research, and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17wt33h&quot; data-start=&quot;5836&quot; data-end=&quot;5926&quot;&gt;Direct exposure to senior leadership, world-class academics, and international partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Charles River Associates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.crai.com/&quot;&gt;Charles River Associates&lt;/a&gt; is a leading global consulting firm that offers economic, financial, and strategic expertise to major law firms, corporations, and governments around the world. Since 1965, CRA experts have combined rigorous cutting-edge research, state-of-the-art methodology, and proven experience to address our clients’ most complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CRA&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://ecp.crai.com/&quot;&gt;European Competition practice&lt;/a&gt; specialises in providing economic advice on matters of competition policy and regulation.&amp;nbsp;We assist firms and their legal advisors in all types of competition proceedings before competition authorities and courts: mergers and acquisitions, abuse of dominance allegations, cartels, restrictive commercial agreements, market investigations, litigation and disputes, intellectual property or state aid. We also provide advice to regulatory authorities in similar matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Learn more about our work by reviewing our Services and Industries on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/antitrust-competition-economics-practice/&quot;&gt;Antitrust &amp;amp; Competition Economics&lt;/a&gt; is hiring for the following European Union offices in Brussels, Belgium; Dusseldorf and Munich, Germany; Paris, France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &#39;Arial&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Associates work closely with senior consultants on project teams and will have the opportunity to immediately work on some of the largest, high profile and most significant competition cases in Europe, playing a key role in shaping the economic analysis and thinking of these cases. Successful candidates have a strong knowledge of economic concepts and a range of research and quantitative skills. A typical Senior Associate would:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and conceptualise issues, specifying rigorous economic models to analyse market issues and data, undertaking statistical and econometric estimation, and managing the work of research associate staff and colleagues;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervise, train and mentor research associate staff;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the development and presentation of client deliverables, including expert reports and white papers summarising opinions, conclusions, and recommendations using market, industry or client-proprietary data;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a primary point of contact for lawyers and other industry or government clients on a variety of practice-relevant issues;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program, build models and/or perform regression analyses in statistical analysis programs (such as Stata, Python, R, SAS, Matlab, and Mathematica), including large data projects requiring use of cloud computing;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the integrity and accuracy of analyses and opinions; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to practice-building activities (training, recruiting, publication, expertise sharing, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore how CRA can help you&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.crai.com/careers/accelerate&quot;&gt;launch your career&lt;/a&gt; and learn &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJXu817TIZw&quot;&gt;why PhDs choose CRA&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PhD degree in economics with a completion date of December 2026/Summer 2027 and an academic focus on Applied Microeconomics or Applied Microeconometrics, with specializations like industrial organization, labor, health, behavioural and public economics, or other quantitative areas;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Excel, Stata, Python, R, SQL, SAS, ArcGIS/ArcPy, or Cloud computing (Databricks/Spark, Google Cloud, Azure, AWS);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated understanding of, and ability to explain, economic, financial and/or accounting concepts, and quantitative and qualitative analysis methods;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and analytical thinkers who bring creative approaches to non-standard problems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective written and oral communication skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eagerness to learn new skills and programming languages;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated high level of initiative and leadership;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong teamwork and collaboration capabilities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management and task prioritization skills; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and demonstrated interest in consulting through coursework, work experience, activities, or attendance at CRA recruiting events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As much of our work occurs in our offices, minimal travel is required.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be considered for a &lt;strong&gt;position in Europe, submit through this posting&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resume/CV&lt;/strong&gt; – please include current address, email and telephone number;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Covering letter&lt;/strong&gt; – please describe your interest in CRA and how this role matches your goals. Also, please note if you have a location preference;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research/Job market paper&lt;/strong&gt; – please submit your original research or dissertation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Letters of Recommendation&lt;/strong&gt; – please have three (3) LORs submitted directly to -----
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To apply for one of our &lt;strong&gt;other global locations&lt;/strong&gt;, please visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/cra-careers/&quot;&gt;Careers Site&lt;/a&gt; to view available jobs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interviews will be conducted on a rolling basis. Candidates focusing their search on industry and consulting who need to be considered early should indicate that in the CRA online application and submit all materials as early as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth and Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRA’s robust &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/cra-careers/talent-development/&quot;&gt;skills development programs&lt;/a&gt;, including both formal and informal programs, encourage you to thrive as an individual and team member. Beginning with project management skills, training continues with team management/development, client presentation skills, internal seminars, and career mentoring and performance coaching from an assigned senior colleague. Additional leadership and collaboration opportunities exist through internal firm development activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer a comprehensive total rewards program including a competitive salary and superior benefits package (plus a sizeable performance bonus), &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/benefits/&quot;&gt;wellness programming&lt;/a&gt; to support physical, mental, emotional and financial well-being, and in-house &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/cra-careers/immigration-global-mobility/&quot;&gt;immigration support&lt;/a&gt; for foreign nationals and international business travelers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CRA creates a work environment that enables our colleagues to benefit from being together in the office to best deliver on our promise of career growth, mentorship and inclusivity. At the same time, we recognize that individuals realize a range of benefits when working from home periodically. We currently expect that individuals spend at least 3 to 4 days a week working in the office (which may include traveling to another CRA office or to client meetings), with specific days determined in coordination with your practice or team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible AI Use in Recruiting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that recruiting is fundamentally a human process, and we are committed to a hiring process that is consistent, transparent, and people-focused. While AI and other technology-enabled tools help our team operate more efficiently, we strive to provide every candidate with a personalized, thoughtful, and high-touch experience. As CRA invests significant human effort to find qualified members for our teams, we expect candidates to invest corresponding human effort to learn about CRA, prepare thoughtful application materials, and engage with our interviewers. Read more about appropriate hiring manager, recruiting team, and candidate AI at CRA &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crai.com/cra-careers/ai-recruiting/&quot;&gt;on our website&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Charles River Associates is an equal opportunity employer. As part of our focus on equity and inclusion, we work to ensure a fair and consistent hiring process. We celebrate diversity and we are committed to an inclusive work environment.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;11&quot; data-local-id=&quot;93795b139292&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Analytics Engineer to lead the data architecture behind our most business-critical financial work: billing, regulatory reporting (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EMI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; compliance, financial forecasting and executive reporting. You&#39;ll design the data solutions that finance, payments and audit teams depend on, set the standards for how analytics work ships, and mentor others on the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;400&quot; data-local-id=&quot;04e5a5743e87&quot;&gt;This is a shape-the-team role. You&#39;ll have real influence over how we work, what we build and the pace we move at. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We expect you to use AI fluently where it adds leverage in modeling, code review and debugging, and to apply clear judgment on where it doesn&#39;t.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8a127a4eec79&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;69983cc5-7a69-4c5e-8cb0-2d1476fbd536&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;683&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f86dd91255b3&quot;&gt;Lead the architecture and development of high-impact data models in dbt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;759&quot; data-local-id=&quot;637843ae65c8&quot;&gt;Architect data solutions across business-critical financial workflows, including billing, regulatory reporting (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;EMI&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;SOX&lt;/span&gt; compliance, financial forecasting and executive reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;943&quot; data-local-id=&quot;328036a130de&quot;&gt;Mentor analytics engineers and review code to uphold standards across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1026&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3cadb74519a9&quot;&gt;Find and fix performance bottlenecks across the data stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1089&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea6a753ebf9a&quot;&gt;Translate business problems into clean, efficient data solutions in close partnership with stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1197&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6ac1ef55faf8&quot;&gt;Set team-wide standards for documentation, CI/CD, observability and testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;84f45985e13a&quot;&gt;Set the team&#39;s norms for where AI belongs in our workflow, from model development to code review, and where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1426&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bfbd44915343&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;31d514bd-be3b-41a0-8411-e3530a1faabd&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1442&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebab218e4ac8&quot;&gt;5+ years in analytics engineering or a similar role, with a track record of designing data models that hold up to cross-functional use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1581&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cf5dc9cd98d7&quot;&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise with dbt, SQL and Python on a modern data platform (Databricks or equivalent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1688&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5907f55d915c&quot;&gt;Strong grasp of pipeline orchestration, testing frameworks and the practices that keep them healthy at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1801&quot; data-local-id=&quot;766324799f66&quot;&gt;Comfortable setting technical direction, mentoring engineers and working closely with finance, payments and audit stakeholders. You can explain a trade-off clearly and influence the decision that follows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2009&quot; data-local-id=&quot;94d52040e4ec&quot;&gt;You use AI hands-on in your day-to-day technical work and can show specific examples of how it has changed the way you build, review or debug data models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2167&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d29af94c37b5&quot;&gt;You catch AI&#39;s errors before anything ships, including hallucinations, overconfident answers and plausible-but-wrong code, and you have a clear sense of where human oversight stays non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€85.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 008 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 320 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£60,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£72,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;France&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€54.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€65.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW4324591 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW4324591 BCX8&quot;&gt;As a leader in Lawful and Location Intelligence, SS8 helps make societies safer. Our commitment is to extract, analyze, and visualize the critical intelligence that gives law enforcement, intelligence agencies, and emergency services the real-time insights that help save lives. Our high performance, flexible, and future-proof solutions also enable mobile network operators to achieve regulatory compliance with minimum disruption, time, and cost. SS8 is trusted by the largest government agencies, communications providers, and systems integrators globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a customer-facing Senior Solutions Engineer to support sales of SS8’s portfolio across Law Enforcement (LEA), Intelligence Community (IC), and Communications Service Providers (CSPs) across the APAC region. This role sits at the intersection of deep technical expertise and strategic sales—translating complex mission needs into deployable, scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a highly skilled Senior Solutions Engineer, you will leverage your expertise to deliver pre-sales engineering support as a subject matter expert. This role involves extensive engagement with customers and partners, ensuring the highest technical and professional standards while upholding SS8’s customer-first approach. You will serve as the primary technical representative to customers, articulating SS8’s solution capabilities and playing a key role in influencing customer decisions and successful solution adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with sales, product, and delivery teams to drive technical wins, shape customer architectures, and ensure SS8 solutions align with operational and compliance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales &amp;amp; Solution Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery sessions to understand customer mission requirements across lawful intercept, location intelligence, and data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent SS8 and its partner ecosystem in designing and delivering end-to-end solutions tailored to customer and prospect requirements spanning telecom networks, data collection, mediation, analytics, and visualization platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical sales cycle: architecture, solution positioning, demos, POCs, and RFP/RFI responses with innovative and differentiated approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate vague “we need intel” asks into concrete system designs (and push back when needed).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical advisor to LEA, IC, and telecom stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present complex solutions clearly to both engineers and non-technical decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer workshops, technical deep dives, and executive briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge the gap between operational users and IT/network teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop high-level and detailed architectures integrating SS8 solutions into existing customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with telecom standards, lawful intercept frameworks, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with delivery teams to ensure smooth transition from design to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with account teams to develop winning strategies for new and existing opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creation of proposals, quotes, SOWs, and technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support competitive positioning and articulate differentiators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Feedback Loop&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide structured feedback to product management on emerging trends, customer challenges, requirements analysis and field-driven insights based on field experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product direction with real-world use cases and customer pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Required Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in solution and systems engineering, sales engineering, network engineering, or solution architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design and size high-capacity, high-performance, mission-critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of telecom network architectures and signaling protocols:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3G, 4G LTE/EPC, and 5G Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IMS, VoLTE, VoIP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IP networking (routing, switching, protocols)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lawful intercept frameworks and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of data flows, packet capture, and network-based data collection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or working with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Law Enforcement Agencies (LEA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intelligence Community (IC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Telecommunications Service Providers (CSPs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to OSINT, location intelligence, or analytics platforms is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with virtualization and/or cloud-native environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of databases and storage systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of compliance, regulatory, and legal considerations in telecom and surveillance environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Engineering Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to run technical sales cycles and close complex deals. Experience responding to RFPs/RFIs and building technical proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and demo skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with significant experience engaging directly with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly professional, detail-oriented, and analytical, with the ability to operate independently and take initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of contributing as a key member of the technical leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interpersonal Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complex systems without dumbing them down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable pushing back on unrealistic customer expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication across technical, operational, and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven, adaptable, and able to operate in ambiguous environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with big data platforms (Hadoop, Spark, Elasticsearch).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AI/ML applications in intelligence or telecom analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud experience (AWS, Azure, or private cloud deployments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% typical, 75% peak&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Join a company where your ideas, expertise, and ambition can make a real difference.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At SS8, we&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of collaboration, innovation, and continuous growth. Whether you&#39;re developing new solutions, supporting customers, or driving business success, you&#39;ll be part of a team that values your contributions and invests in your future.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW127407533 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW127407533 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;SS8 does not discriminate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;on the basis of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195719623 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;age, disability, gender reassignment, marriage or civil partnership, pregnancy or maternity, race, religion or belief, sex, or sexual orientation, and provides reasonable adjustments throughout the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW17735712 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW17735712 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;SS8 does not accept unsolicited resumes from staffing agencies, search firms, or third parties. Any resumes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;submitted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW64983816 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;without a signed agreement in place will be considered the property of Company, and no fees will be paid if a candidate is hired as a result.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cybercrime is growing, and more businesses are getting hit by threats that used to target only the biggest organizations. That pushes defenders like us to operate at the highest level, and it deepens our need for good people who want to make a meaningful impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2015 by former NSA cyber operators, Huntress is a remote-first team working to make enterprise-grade cybersecurity accessible to businesses of all sizes. We work closely with security teams and service providers protecting complex environments, often without the time or headcount to handle it all. That’s why we build our technology in-house and back it with a 24/7 human-led Security Operations Center (SOC). As a result, our platform is never disconnected from the experts who manage it, ensuring our customers&#39; protection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Huntress now secures more than 6M endpoints and 17M identities worldwide. Those numbers keep growing because more businesses rely on us to help carry the load and operate with more confidence. Every day, you can see that commitment in how we stand with our customers and how we show up for each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: Senior Manager, Channel Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Remote UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range: £90,000 to £100,000 base plus bonus and equity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Huntress is looking for a Senior Channel Marketing Manager to plan and execute channel marketing across EMEA, working with both distributors and resellers. You will make sure our distribution partners, and the resellers they serve, have the programs, content, and funding to generate demand for Huntress across several markets, and you will build campaigns that bring new resellers into the region&#39;s partner ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is execution-focused. The ideal candidate is organized, comfortable running many campaigns and partner relationships at once, and skilled at adapting global programs to regional needs. You are data-driven, collaborative, and passionate about helping partners succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute regional marketing programs with EMEA distributors and resellers, including demand generation campaigns, webinars, events, and product launch activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and run campaigns to recruit new resellers in the region via distributor-led recruitment and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day marketing relationships with distributor partners and resellers, including joint plans, campaign calendars, and regular performance reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable distributors to run marketing to their reseller base, and support priority resellers directly where the impact is greatest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Localize and adapt global campaigns, messaging, and assets for regional markets, including language, regulatory, and market-specific needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan the activities and campaigns that put MDF and co-marketing funds to work across distributors and resellers, partnering with the Program Manager who administers MDF, and report on the results and ROI of funded activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Marketing to deliver product updates and channel-specific campaigns that drive partner activation, product adoption, and lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain partner-ready enablement and co-branded materials for distributors and resellers, and support engagement through the Huntress Hub partner portal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on regional channel marketing KPIs, including partner engagement, pipeline, campaign conversion, and fund utilization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify what distributors and resellers need to market Huntress successfully and bring those insights back to the Channel Programs team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regional partner events, distributor business reviews, and partner communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent follow-up on all channel-generated leads, with accurate lead capture, tracking, and prompt routing to the appropriate internal owner for next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring To The Team:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in channel or partner marketing, ideally in the SaaS or cybersecurity space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running co-marketing programs through distributors and resellers in EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and running partner or reseller recruitment campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the EMEA channel landscape, including how distribution models and reseller tiers differ by country and region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning MDF-funded or co-marketing activities and working within channel program mechanics such as deal registration and lead sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to plan, manage, and execute many campaigns and partner relationships at once across markets and time zones, and pivot quickly as needs change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to assess opportunities and make ROI-based decisions on programs and investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills, with the ability to lead, influence, and collaborate across organizational and geographic boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CRM, marketing automation, and PRM or partner portal tools (e.g., Salesforce, HubSpot).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel across EMEA as needed for Partner events, QBRs, etc.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity, MSP, or SMB-focused markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in one or more European languages in addition to English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with GDPR and regional marketing compliance requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like in the First Year&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Joint marketing plans running with your key distributors and priority resellers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regional campaigns executed on a consistent cadence with measurable pipeline impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stronger distributor-led demand generation to the reseller base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruitment campaigns in market that add new, active resellers to the program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-planned, MDF-funded activity across the region with a clear view of ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% remote work environment - since our founding in 2015&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New starter home office set up reimbursement (£398)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous personal leave entitlements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital monthly reimbursement (£92)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to the US 1-2 times/year for various company events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the BetterUp platform for coaching, personal, and professional growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Huntress is committed to creating a culture of inclusivity where every single member of our team is valued, has a voice, and is empowered to come to work every day just as they are.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We do not discriminate based on race, ethnicity, color, ancestry, national origin, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, disability, veteran status, genetic information, marital status, or any other legally protected status. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We do discriminate against hackers who try to exploit businesses of all sizes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you require reasonable accommodation to complete this application, interview, or pre-employment testing or participate in the employee selection process, please direct your inquiries to &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a ---------- Please note that non-accommodation requests to this inbox will not receive a response.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Huntress uses artificial intelligence tools to assist in reviewing and evaluating job applications, including resume screening, skills assessment, and candidate matching and comparisons. These AI tools support our human recruiters in the initial review process, but do not make final hiring decisions without human involvement. By submitting your application, you acknowledge this use of AI in our recruitment process. Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://trust.huntress.com/?itemUid=47f0a941-b86f-4864-a0d0-a224a34cfd57&amp;amp;source=click&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more details on our practices and your data privacy rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
