&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI Principal&lt;/strong&gt; to act as a senior technical authority and trusted client advisor for complex agentic AI transformation in the UK and Ireland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at Principal level, you will shape enterprise AI strategy, define agentic architecture blueprints, lead high-value C-suite engagements and guide complex programmes from opportunity through delivery. You will bring deep hands-on credibility in multi-agent systems, governance and safeguards, while setting reusable patterns and raising capability across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role has particular focus on sovereign, compliant and production-grade agentic AI for regulated UK enterprise environments, including financial services and telecommunications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI Advisory &amp;amp; Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Shape and solution complex UKI pursuits, working with account, commercial and delivery leaders to translate client needs into differentiated propositions, credible architectures and executable delivery approaches that support regional pipeline conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Build Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Set the architecture direction for complex, production-grade agentic AI systems, including multi-agent workflows, orchestration, tool use, memory, context strategy, retrieval, evaluation, observability and enterprise integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Safeguards: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish reusable patterns for observability, auditability, traceability and control of agentic systems, enabling teams to demonstrate safe and reliable behaviour in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal-level leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Set reusable architecture patterns, engineering standards and governance practices across multiple teams and engagements, influencing the evolution of Thoughtworks’ agentic AI capability beyond an individual programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design solutions appropriate for regulated UK environments, including financial services and telecommunications, with strong consideration of data sovereignty, privacy, security, responsible AI and applicable regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical and delivery leadership for complex programmes, maintaining sufficient hands-on involvement to validate architecture, unblock teams, manage technical risk and ensure successful execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction across multiple teams and initiatives, defining reusable patterns, frameworks and engineering standards for agentic AI delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide teams in balancing rapid experimentation with robust production engineering, including evaluation-driven development, testing, CI/CD, reliability, cost and performance optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, data, software engineering, enterprise architecture, governance and change specialists to design end-to-end solutions that deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate technical, organisational and governance challenges in enterprise AI adoption and define practical approaches to address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior engineers and technical leads, uplift broader engineering capability, and build confidence in agentic AI practices across specialists and generalists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging agentic AI technologies and frameworks and guide their responsible adoption based on client context, engineering quality and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Thoughtworks&#39; agentic AI expertise in strategic client conversations, industry forums, partnerships and thought leadership where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;modern software engineering and Python&lt;/strong&gt;, with a &lt;strong&gt;strong track record of setting standards for testing, CI/CD, observability, maintainability and production reliability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised experience architecting and delivering complex GenAI and agentic AI systems at enterprise scale, from early discovery through production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of agentic architectures and frameworks such as LangGraph, AutoGen, CrewAI, LlamaIndex or equivalent, including tool use, orchestration, memory and multi-t coordination patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Retrieval-Augmented Generation, advanced information retrieval, vector databases and enterprise knowledge integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing evaluation strategies for GenAI and agentic systems, including quality, safety, reliability, latency and cost measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI governance and safeguards, including guardrails, red-teaming, observability, responsible AI and secure deployment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience deploying AI systems on major cloud platforms using containers, orchestration and production-grade infrastructure patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with model adaptation and optimisation techniques, including prompt/context engineering, fine-tuning where appropriate, and application-level performance optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make sound architecture trade-offs across model capability, reliability, security, compliance, performance and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead C-suite and senior client engagements, rapidly establish credibility and advise on both business and technical choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consulting and commercial judgement, including experience shaping high-value opportunities, building investment cases and contributing directly to complex pipeline conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead AI maturity assessments, identify and prioritise processes for agentization, and connect architecture choices to measurable business value and ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and communication skills, with the ability to make complex agentic AI concepts, risks and trade-offs clear to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership of complex delivery across multidisciplinary teams, with the ability to move fluidly between strategy, architecture, governance and hands-on technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence across organisations without relying on formal authority, align diverse stakeholders and navigate ambiguity in high-value or high-risk programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to mentor senior engineers and technical leaders and to raise standards and capability across a wider engineering community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Legend&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Legend is a world-leading sports and gaming media network, reaching hundreds of millions of visitors a year. We&#39;re now part of Genius Sports. Together, we’re combining Legend’s audience, brands and product expertise with Genius Sports’ real-time data, technology and capabilities to create the next generation of fan-facing media and advertising. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;l1.com&quot;&gt;l1.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Legend, we&#39;re building next-level player experiences. With 20+ years of proven success we’re the world&#39;s leading Sports and Gaming marketing company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our people are our edge. 600+ sharp, ambitious Legends across 22+ countries who move fast, learn quickly and win together. Here growth isn’t a perk, it’s the standard. You’ll stretch, level-up and carve out a career as bold as the products we build. We celebrate wins and create experiences that people talk about for years - for our players &amp;amp; for each other. If you’re ready to shape the future of player experience and enjoy the ride while you do it, this is where you’ll thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Legend is hiring a Principal Technical SEO, reporting directly to our Chief Gaming Officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to take portfolio-wide responsibility for the technical SEO performance of some of the largest and most commercially important domains in iGaming. Working alongside our existing Principal Technical SEO, you will co-own technical SEO across our Gaming portfolio, while also supporting our Sports portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will identify the technical opportunities and risks that matter most, turn them into clear priorities, and work closely with Product and Engineering to deliver measurable organic and commercial impact. This is a deeply hands-on role where you will solve complex challenges across crawling, rendering, indexation, architecture, internal linking, internationalisation, migrations and performance, while setting standards that scale across our portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also play a key role in advancing how we use AI and automation across SEO. You will build tools, monitoring, diagnostics and automated workflows yourself, using technology to improve the speed and quality of decision-making and helping our wider SEO teams adopt these capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role with significant autonomy and visibility. You will lead through expertise rather than formal authority, working alongside senior specialists and leaders across SEO, Product, Engineering and Analytics to shape decisions across the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, we value diverse perspectives and encourage you to apply even if you don&#39;t meet every qualification listed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-own our portfolio-wide technical SEO strategy, roadmap and standards, identifying and prioritising the opportunities and risks with the greatest potential organic and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex technical investigations across crawling, rendering, indexation, architecture, internal linking, international SEO, migrations, structured data and web performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering on architecture, major releases, migrations and experimentation, translating technical SEO insights into clear priorities and scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automated monitoring, diagnostics and early-warning systems that identify material technical issues before they become significant commercial problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop internal tools and AI-enabled workflows that improve analysis, quality assurance, prioritisation and execution across technical SEO and the wider SEO organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable technical patterns, guardrails and frameworks across our portfolio, raising technical capability through coaching, documentation and shared tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Repeated technical SEO impact at scale&lt;/strong&gt;- a strong track record of personally leading complex technical SEO initiatives across large websites or multi-domain portfolios, with clear evidence of measurable organic or commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional technical SEO depth and judgement&lt;/strong&gt;- expert knowledge across crawling, rendering, indexation, architecture, internal linking, canonicalisation, international SEO, migrations, structured data, JavaScript SEO, log-file analysis and web performance, with the judgement to separate material opportunities from technical hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and strategic thinking&lt;/strong&gt;- able to translate complex technical findings into priorities based on expected value, risk, effort, confidence and opportunity cost, connecting technical decisions to organic and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal-level influence&lt;/strong&gt;- experienced in influencing Product, Engineering and senior stakeholders without direct authority, challenging constructively and communicating complex technical decisions clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A builder&#39;s mindset&lt;/strong&gt;- intellectually curious, technically self-sufficient and comfortable remaining deeply hands-on while creating systems, standards and capabilities that increase the impact of teams beyond your own individual contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Interview Process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1st: Initial chat with our Talent Partner - 30 minutes via Zoom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2nd: Interview with our Chief Gaming Officer - 60 minutes via Zoom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3rd: Technical SEO interview with senior members of our SEO team - 60 minutes via Zoom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4th: Case presentation and Principal peer interview - 90 minutes via Zoom, including a technical SEO assessment prepared ahead of the interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Tenable?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable® is the Exposure Management company. Over 40,000 organizations around the globe rely on Tenable to understand and reduce cyber risk. Our global employees support 65 percent of the Fortune 500, 50 percent of the Global 2000, and large government agencies. Come be part of our journey!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes Tenable such a great place to work?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ask a member of our team and they’ll answer, “Our people!” We work together to build and innovate best-in-class cybersecurity solutions for our customers; all while creating a culture of belonging, respect, and excellence where we can be our best selves. When you’re part of our #OneTenable team, you can expect to partner with some of the most talented and passionate people in the industry, and have the support and resources you need to do work that truly matters. We deliver results that exceed expectations and we win together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have built a career carrying a number, and now you want to grow big accounts for the long term. This role is for you. You will own renewals and expansion for 30 to 40 of Tenable&#39;s strategic customers, including the largest account in EMEA. Retention and growth in these accounts is now a top priority, so your impact will be visible fast. You will be in front of customers and in the room with senior leaders, working side by side with our Enterprise and Commercial Territory Managers and Solutions Engineers as an equal. This is a sales role with a Customer Success title.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mandate is to keep our largest customers and grow them. You will protect recurring revenue, find the next opportunity in every account, and set the standard for what a Principal CSM looks like at Tenable. Keep our biggest customers, and keep them growing strategic customers stay when they see the value. You will make it clear, and make it last.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the full renewal cycle for a multi-million book, with retention as your first measure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spot churn and downgrade risk early, using adoption data and your own judgement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Negotiate enterprise contracts that protect revenue and open the door to more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turn every account into the next big deal, renewals and expansion are an equal share of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run strategic discovery with senior stakeholders to uncover high-value opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build the business case for upsell and cross-sell across the Tenable platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Carry an expansion quota, and take ownership of the number.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Win as one account team, you and the Territory Manager are partners, and you often carry the bigger number.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plan each account together with Territory Managers and Solutions Engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead critical escalations, and bring in Engineering, Support and Professional Services at pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Share what you hear from customers, so it shapes our product and service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape what Principal means, this is still a new level for us, and you will help define it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set the playbook for renewals and expansion in strategic accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Mentor junior and senior CSMs, and show them what great looks like.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Build the experience and profile that opens a path to team leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;By six months: a plan and a trusted forecast for every strategic account, and a senior contact in each one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;By twelve months: retention ahead of baseline, double-digit growth in your book, and a team that looks to you for best practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A sales background, with a record of meeting or beating quota through renewals, upsell and cross-sell.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience of large, complex accounts and enterprise contract negotiation, ideally using a structured method such as MEDDPICC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;The standing to build trusted relationships with senior leaders in large organisations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Comfort with visibility: you share account status openly and welcome scrutiny.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A team player who shares knowledge freely and enjoys helping others grow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A hands-on approach: you build your own quotes and keep your own Salesforce records.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Curiosity about new tools, including AI-led churn tracking, and an eye for what the data says.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Availability for three office days a week in Staines, and travel up to 25% of the time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Interview Process&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recruiter Screen – 1st Stage - Virtual&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hiring Manager Interview&amp;nbsp; – 2nd Stage – Virtual/F2F&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Panel Interview -&amp;nbsp;3rd Stage - F2F&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Leader Interview&amp;nbsp;- 4th Stage - Virtual/F2F&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exec Level Call - Final Stage - Virtual&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JG1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We’re committed to promoting Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO) at Tenable - through all equal employment opportunity laws and regulations at the international, federal, state and local levels.&amp;nbsp; If you need a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please contact&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- for further assistance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tenable Data Consent Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tenable is committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal data. Depending on your location, one or more of the following notices may apply to you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_General_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;General Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_CCPA_Notice_Applicants_FINAL_4-29-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static.tenable.com/marketing/hr/Tenable_EEA_UK_Applicant_Privacy_Notice_FINAL_6-4-2026_branded.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EU/EEA/UK Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Abnormal AI, we protect our customers against nefarious adversaries who are constantly evolving their techniques and tactics to outwit and undermine the traditional approaches to Security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About The Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team owns the end-to-end development and operation of the infrastructure, ML models, AI agents, customer-facing APIs, and internal tools that power Abnormal&#39;s Identity Threat Protection (ITP) product. Our work is central to detecting malicious behavior and protecting customers from advanced identity-based attacks — including account takeover, identity spoofing, data leakage, and other high-impact threats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Software Engineer to help build and evolve our platform as it scales to meet expanding product requirements. This role blends hands-on backend systems development with growing ownership of features and production systems, including AI-powered and agentic components, working closely with senior engineers to improve system reliability, reduce latency, and accelerate feature release cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Delivery &amp;amp; Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and iterate on scalable backend and ML systems, APIs, frameworks, and internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of well-scoped features and components, with guidance from senior engineers on more complex, cross-system work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the stability, reliability, and operational excellence of critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, testable, and resilient code with attention to edge cases and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical design documents and participate in design discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code and design reviews, and contribute to on-call rotations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Engineering &amp;amp; Agents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design and build LLM-powered features and agentic workflows (e.g., automated investigation, triage, or remediation assistants) as part of the ATO platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate LLM APIs and agent frameworks into backend services, with attention to reliability, cost, latency, and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to prompt design, tool/function-calling integrations, and guardrails for AI-driven components under senior engineer guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use GenAI coding assistants and agents as part of your own development workflow to accelerate delivery and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers, designers, and engineers to align on specifications and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break down well-defined projects into clear executable steps and drive them to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to roadmap discussions and share ideas for technical improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively in an async-first environment, providing clarity on updates, challenges, and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively seek feedback and mentorship from senior engineers to accelerate your growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Growth: &lt;/strong&gt;A proactive engineer who takes ownership of assigned work and is eager to grow into increasingly complex projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to Detail: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong focus on code quality, reliability, monitoring, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid Fundamentals: &lt;/strong&gt;Good grounding in system design principles, with a growing ability to reason about scaling and reliability tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Collaborator: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfortable working cross-functionally and in a distributed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Agent Engineering Curiosity: &lt;/strong&gt;Genuine interest in LLM-powered features and agentic systems, and proactive in leveraging modern developer productivity tools, including GenAI assistants and coding agents, to accelerate delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of industry experience as a Software Engineer, with a track record of shipping production backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid backend proficiency in Python, with experience building and maintaining production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system design fundamentals and building reliable, scalable applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of relational databases and modern data storage technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to service-to-service communication (gRPC, Kafka) and caching (Redis) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS cloud services (S3, RDS) and deployment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with containerization and orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes, Helm) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of service health, monitoring, and incident response practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable writing technical documentation and contributing to design discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice-to-Have Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience integrating LLM APIs (e.g., OpenAI, Anthropic) into production applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to agent frameworks or patterns (e.g., LangChain, LangGraph, tool/function calling, ReAct-style agents).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with prompt engineering, evaluation, and observability for AI-driven features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ML1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note on AI in our process:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Abnormal AI uses AI-assisted tools to help our recruiting team prepare for candidate interviews. These tools analyze resume content and role requirements to suggest interview questions and areas for the interviewer to explore.They do not make hiring decisions or screen candidates automatically. Every decision about a candidacy is made by a person. Further, if your application is successful and Abnormal AI makes a conditional offer of employment, we will carry out pre-employment checks which must be successfully completed to progress to a final offer. All processes and pre-employment checks are in line with prevailing legislation and Abnormal AI&#39;s policies relevant to our security and privacy standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Abnormal AI is an equal opportunity employer. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, protected veteran status or other characteristics protected by law. For our EEO policy statement please &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt3a076cfd9753fa1f/blt9cbda641db7c0045/6a1e3d3a66aea075cd33e462/AAP_and_EEO_Statement.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;click here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. If you would like more information on your EEO rights under the law, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt3a076cfd9753fa1f/blt4eb3a265cc7b1ca9/6a1e3d3bfe33e73c16ff026b/EEOC_Know_Your_Rights_Oct_30_2025.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London or Remote (UK) | 💰 £94,700 - £111,400 ➕ incentive awards tied to your performance | &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers#benefits&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDAT6VxoqQM&quot;&gt;Hear from the team&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a hands-on, detail-oriented and proactive &lt;strong&gt;Operational Tax Senior Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to support the Tax team at Monzo, and our wider Finance and Product teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be joining our Tax Team and will be leading on all taxes that touch our customers and their tax reporting, across the UK and Europe. You’ll report into our Tax Governance Lead.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role covers all taxes that relate to customer liabilities or customer tax reporting. These are a core part of product design: we make sure we comply with our own obligations, and we make it as easy as possible for customers to comply with theirs. As we launch new products and enter new markets, this is a key area of our tax strategy, and this role gives you the exciting opportunity to own it and work closely with diverse teams across the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning operational tax:&lt;/strong&gt; Be Monzo’s subject matter expert on operational tax, advising the business and making sure we meet our obligations as we grow and enter new markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading compliance &amp;amp; controls: &lt;/strong&gt;Own our operational tax processes and controls across jurisdictions, including BBSI, ISA reporting, FATCA and CRS, Corporate Criminal Offence and CT61s, plus overseas equivalents. Build new processes and controls as our products and markets evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping new products:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product and local market teams from the outset to embed tax into product design, build the right reporting and controls, and pressure-test edge cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staying ahead of change:&lt;/strong&gt; Keep on top of tax laws, regulations and case law across the UK and EU, translating changes into clear actions and helping Monzo prepare for new requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnering across Monzo: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with Product, Financial Crime, Engineering, Legal, EU Next Markets and Finance to solve problems and support business initiatives from an operational tax perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a qualified accountant and/or qualified tax advisor, or qualified by significant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant in-house experience working in Operational Tax.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working relatively autonomously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re energetic and are hands-on with your work, tackling whatever needs doing to make things happen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an eye for detail and enjoy working methodically through processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What we’re doing at Monzo excites you!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £94,700 - £111,400 + incentive awards tied to your performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍 We&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK, with the expectation of working from the London office on occasional basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more!&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers#benefits&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈 The application journey has 4 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Phone call with Recruiter (30 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial video call with Tax member (30 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study video interview with Hiring Manager and Tax member (60 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder interview (45 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 3–4 weeks, but we will always work around your availability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll only close this role once we have enough applications for the next stage. Please submit your application as soon as possible to make sure you don’t miss out.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. You can read them&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-NZ1 #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍 London, Cardiff or UK Remote | 💰 £150,900 to £204,100 + stock options &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt; | ✅ Visa sponsorship &amp;amp; relocation available&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our Data Discipline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a strong culture of data-driven decision making across the whole company. Data is central to how we understand our customers, shape our products, manage risk and grow Monzo sustainably. We believe in empowering teams with high-quality, trusted data and self-serve analytics, while creating space for Data practitioners to focus on the highest-impact questions, opportunities and decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Data Discipline is deeply embedded in Monzo’s product areas. Data Scientists, Analytics Engineers, and Machine Learning Engineers work in cross-functional squads alongside Engineers, Designers, Product Managers and other disciplines. This means Data is not a downstream service, and instead we shape strategy, challenge thinking, build the data foundations teams need to move quickly, and share accountability for customer and commercial outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Growth and Marketing Analytics team &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Data Director to join our Growth and Marketing Collective here at Monzo. Our goal in Growth and Marketing is to build Monzo into a global brand people love. We&#39;re the team that finds exciting new ways to bring customers to Monzo and keep them engaged once they join. We create the features and cool stuff that gets everyone talking about us. We also figure out the best ways to communicate with our customers. Data is a driving force in everything we do, and this role will lead the team making sure our Growth and Marketing folks can easily use data to inform their every day decisions. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑 You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On day one, you&#39;ll develop and nurture a diverse data team to make smart marketing and product driven growth investments. You’ll work closely with the Growth and Marketing collective leadership team to set the overall direction and work with your team to craft the insights, data products, and intelligent systems to realise those ambitions.&amp;nbsp;You’ll help us with the following questions and challenges:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define our global marketing strategy as well as our product growth one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to balance growing different markets and customer segments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance our measurement precisions to grow our confidence in where to best invest next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balancing marketing with product driven growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply understand network effects and the role they play&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re excited about what we’re doing at Monzo and have experience leading Data teams at Director level or above.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an empathetic, inclusive leader who has hired, developed and retained high-performing Data teams, including individual contributors and managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a hands-on Data Science background and can move comfortably between technical detail, commercial outcomes and customer strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep experience in marketing measurement, experimentation and choosing the right methods to guide investment and growth decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve led goal-setting across a company or division, defining clear metrics and targets in partnership with Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can turn complex business challenges into technical solutions and clear, actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build strong relationships across business areas and are comfortable influencing senior stakeholders, including ExCo and C-level leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable with ambiguity and use data to challenge thinking, navigate trade-offs and improve how teams make decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈 The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minute recruiter call&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;60 minute call with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 x 1-hour video calls with various team members, including the General Manager for Growth &amp;amp; Marketing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 3-4 weeks but we will always work around your availability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £150,900 to £204,100 ➕ plus stock options &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers#benefits&quot;&gt;benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK/Spain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 Learning budget of £1,000 a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JH1&amp;nbsp; #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About InstaLILY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://portal.instalily.ai/i/homepage&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;InstaLILY&lt;/a&gt; is an AI products and infrastructure company that puts execution at the frontier of enterprise AI. That work begins with &lt;a href=&quot;https://portal.instalily.ai/i/lily&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Lily™&lt;/a&gt;, the world&#39;s first AI Forward Deployed Engineer, which learns how a business works, builds the software it needs, and goes live in days. It does not leave when the work ships; it stays and keeps the software working as the business changes. Lily runs wherever the work happens, in the cloud, on-premise, or at the edge, through InstaLILY&#39;s Small Data Center, built with NVIDIA technology. Founded in 2023 by Amit Shah and Sumantro Das, InstaLILY has raised nearly $100 million from Energize Capital, Insight Partners, and Home Depot Ventures. Headquartered in New York, with offices in San Francisco, London, and Toronto, InstaLILY serves leading companies across construction, industrial distribution, logistics, healthcare, and other operationally intensive industries. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://instalily.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://instalily.ai/&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Traction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Revenue grew 5x over the past year, and Lily has driven over $200M in new annual sales for a single customer. We serve some of the largest operators in our industries, including SRS Distribution (part of The Home Depot family), United Rentals, and Henry Schein, and we work closely with the Google DeepMind and NVIDIA ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work in small teams with real ownership: clear problems, direct access to the customers whose work you&#39;re changing, and room to ship. Your code runs in live production systems inside billion-dollar operations, so you see your impact directly. People who do well here want that proximity to the work. We&#39;re growing fast, and the people who join now shape what this company becomes. Everything runs on three principles: Customers, Culture, and Code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue to develop the core AI platform and drive technical excellence throughout the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams (product, UI/UX, business development) to design and implement new features and capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly learn into the expected quality and reliability of the platform through comprehensive testing and continuous integration/continuous delivery (CI/CD) practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a rapport with the Lead Software Engineer and Head of Product while fostering a culture of continuous learning and improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the product and design teams to deliver high-quality products that meet customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date with the latest AI and software engineering trends and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, engineering, Mathematics, Physics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First Class degree preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0 to 2 years of experience as a software engineer (prior software engineering internships and experience/projects a significant plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for understanding AI and machine learning technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python, JavaScript, and other programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud computing technologies OR experience with AWS, Azure, or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of delivering successful products / working in a collaborative, fast-paced environment is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Get&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real traction:&lt;/strong&gt; The product works, customers are live, and we&#39;ve already driven over $200M in incremental revenue for customers — this isn&#39;t a bet on an unproven thesis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Backed by Insight Partners with deep ecosystem partnerships across Google, NVIDIA, and Microsoft. InstaLILY&#39;s architecture has been featured in Google DeepMind&#39;s case study showcase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer impact:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll drive measurable operational change inside the customers you own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage:&lt;/strong&gt; Early enough to shape how InstaLILY runs customer relationships and expansion at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Offices in New York, San Francisco, and London — sharp, low-ego team moving fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; The learning curve is steep&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Compensation and Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range:&lt;/strong&gt; £54,000–£62,000 per year, commensurate with experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity: &lt;/strong&gt;Generous stock options awards, and refreshers for top performers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits: &lt;/strong&gt;Supplemental benefits, pension contribution, in-office Lunch reimbursement, Wellbeing Stipend, Generous Parental leave, PTO and UK National Holidays, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;Quality Over Quantity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure a focused, high-quality hiring experience, we kindly ask candidates to limit their applications to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;c&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;3 open requisitions at any given time&lt;/strong&gt;. Applying strategically to roles that best align with your skills and career goals gives you the highest chance of standing out. Have you interviewed with us in the past 12 months? We encourage you to reach out directly to your previous interviewer rather than submitting a new application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;InstaLILY is committed to providing an inclusive and barrier-free recruitment process. If you require an accommodation, please let us know, and we will work with you to meet your needs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We use AI to assist with parts of our application review process. If you’d like to opt out, please contact our recruiting team (&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- -----<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Fraud Alert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve learned that scammers are impersonating Commvault team members—including HR and leadership—via email or text. These bad actors may conduct fake interviews and ask for personal information, such as your social security number. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to know:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commvault does&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;not&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;conduct interviews by email or text.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We will never ask you to submit sensitive documents (including banking information, SSN, etc) before your first day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commvault recruiters may contact prospective candidates through LinkedIn and other professional networking platforms regarding career opportunities. If you are unsure whether a recruiting communication is legitimate, review the profile to ensure they have a badge verifying them as a Commvault employee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you suspect a recruiting scam, please contact us at &lt;u&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Commvault&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault (NASDAQ: CVLT) delivers continuous recovery for the AI era. We help organizations stay ready for constant disruption by returning critical data, applications, identities, and AI systems to a clean, trusted state. Our purpose-built recovery solutions span cloud-native and hybrid environments, leveraging AI to enable resilience at enterprise scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Channel Sales Engineer is responsible for providing pre-sales technical / functional support to channel sales teams and the partner eco-system in their region. They have a focus on securing end user license revenue whilst maintaining high levels of partner contact and awareness through technical support and enablement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We require a highly technical person based in France, with outstanding commercial skills to join our team. Do you have the ability to collaborate closely with partners in order to successfully position our value above and beyond the competition?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the regional Pre-Sales team reporting to Channel Pre-Sales Leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and demonstrate the Commvault software suite of products through the use of appropriate media – presentation, white board and demonstrations, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal departments (sales, support, marketing, channel), as appropriate, to ensure success during sales campaigns and/or to ensure the partner experience is positive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in achieving annual revenue goals in line with the Commvault’s regional business plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend meetings, training and maintain regular communication with the regional / global Pre-Sales community and other technical and development functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an inspiration leader within the Pre-Sales division and a go-to resource&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven knowledge and experience within Software / SaaS industry in a similar capacity. Ideally within Data Management / Security and Cyber Resiliency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wide range of technical knowledge of data management inclusive of applications, cloud, compliance, disaster recovery, tape infrastructure, storage arrays, storage networking, networking protocols, and general connectivity in multi-platform enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic, fast paced individual who is motivated by success and takes the responsibility of owning issues to resolution. Understands the true meaning of “ownership” and “will do”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional internal and client centric interpersonal skills in a commercial situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shown success in taking care of Enterprise clients and working on high level deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working on sophisticated RFPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competence with prioritising work and balancing workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French &amp;amp; English verbal and written language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-SK1&lt;/p&gt;
