&lt;h2&gt;About the job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turn complex network faults into lasting fixes, and make new services ready for reliable operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Network Operations Engineer in Bristol, UK, you’ll keep Graphcore’s networks reliable and secure. This full-time role spans the network lifecycle, from shaping operational requirements to resolving complex incidents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your improvements will reduce downtime and manual errors across new and existing services. You’ll help colleagues operate services confidently, with practical runbooks and recovery procedures ready when problems arise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll troubleshoot routing and firewalls, improve monitoring and automate routine operations. You’ll also support upgrades and deployments through testing, controlled changes and clear handovers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your scope includes AWS networking, Cisco Software-Defined Access and SD-WAN across cloud and on-premises environments. Occasional travel to remote data centres and offices will involve installations, troubleshooting and hands-on support.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The team and culture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a supportive, multidisciplinary IT infrastructure team that works closely together and regularly shares knowledge. With new projects ahead, you’ll bring operational experience into network designs alongside architects and project teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior escalation point, you’ll own complex incidents through to resolution. You’ll use monitoring evidence and recurring incident trends to prioritise reliability improvements.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AWS networking, Cisco Software-Defined Access (SDA) or SD-WAN experience would be particularly valuable, but is not essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least five years’ hands-on network engineering experience, focused on production support, with certification in a major networking platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical knowledge of large-scale L2/L3 networks, including BGP, OSPF, switching, routing and resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting centrally controlled Wi-Fi, such as Cisco Meraki or Aruba, and resolving connectivity and performance issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and troubleshooting centralised firewalls, including rulesets, NAT and VPNs, plus familiarity with open-source products such as pfSense.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on use of Ansible, Python or similar tools to automate operations and manage network configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence-led troubleshooting using monitoring, packet captures and logs, alongside clear communication, documentation and sound judgement during incidents.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we have outlined a set of requirements, we value transferable skills and diverse experiences. We also welcome engineers returning to the profession after a career break, including through returnship routes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible working:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous leave:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retirement planning support:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Up to 5% matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phantom equity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Peace of mind protection:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Electric Vehicle Scheme:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Choose an electric vehicle and lease it through salary sacrifice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme and dental cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Sponsorship&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the UK. Unfortunately, we are unable to provide visa sponsorship or support visa applications for this role.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to controlled technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some roles at Graphcore involve access to technology subject to U.S. export control regulations. Depending on the role, we may need to assess whether export authorisation is required, taking account of factors such as work location, citizenship and immigration status. Where authorisation is required, this may affect whether or when you can start the role. We’ll explain any relevant requirements during the recruitment process.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Join the Team at Graphcore&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphcore is one of the world’s leading innovators in Artificial Intelligence compute. It is developing hardware, software and systems infrastructure that will unlock the next generation of AI breakthroughs and power the widespread adoption of AI solutions across every industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the SoftBank Group, Graphcore is a member of an elite family of companies responsible for some of the world’s most transformative technologies. Together, they share a bold vision: to enable Artificial Super Intelligence and ensure its benefits are accessible to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphcore’s teams are drawn from diverse backgrounds and bring a broad range of skills and perspectives. A melting pot of AI research specialists, silicon designers, software engineers and systems architects, Graphcore brings together deep expertise to solve complex problems and deliver meaningful progress in AI compute.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply to join Graphcore in Bristol and turn your network operations expertise into more reliable services.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.organization-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Launched in 2021, Fanatics Betting and Gaming is the online and retail sports betting subsidiary of Fanatics, a global digital sports platform. The Fanatics Sportsbook is available to 95% of the addressable online sports bettor market in the U.S. Fanatics Casino is currently available online in Michigan, New Jersey, Pennsylvania and West Virginia. Fanatics Betting and Gaming operates twenty-two retail sports betting locations, including the only sportsbook inside an NFL stadium at Northwest Stadium. Fanatics Betting and Gaming is headquartered in New York with offices in Denver, Leeds and Dublin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming (FBG) is seeking a Senior Platform Engineer to join our Platform Engineering team. This role will sit in either our Runtime/Compute or the Developer Experience/CICD squad.&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Platform Engineer, you will work across cloud infrastructure, Kubernetes platforms, CI/CD systems, and internal developer tooling. You will work closely with Product Engineering, Security, Infrastructure IT, and other platform teams to build, enhance, and support our developer platform. You will help define standards and best practices, and act as a force multiplier for engineering teams by improving reliability, scalability, and developer productivity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver medium-to-large platform projects from implementation through &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain internal platform services and tooling that improve developer experience and delivery velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with application teams to unblock delivery and align platform capabilities with developer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cloud cost efficiency and optimization across our cloud and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve operational excellence through observability, automation, and incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evolve CI/CD pipelines and GitOps-based workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior engineers through code reviews and knowledge sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in on-call rotations and incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7 years of experience in platform, infrastructure, DevOps, or software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Python and Java. Familiarity with Kotlin, Go a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep Kubernetes and container orchestration knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven CI/CD and GitOps experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure as Code expertise (Terraform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong AWS and cloud-native experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating distributed, high-availability systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership mindset and ability to deliver defined projects independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and strong collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with internal developer platforms or tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to regulated or high-availability environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend development experience (Java, Python, Go, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with observability and reliability engineering practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Platform Engineering at FBG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Platform Engineering at FBG operates with a product-first mindset. Our mission is to empower developers with reliable, scalable, and intuitive platforms that accelerate innovation and delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Across Regions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role operates in a globally distributed environment, working closely with teams across the UK, Ireland, and the United States. Strong communication, time zone coordination, and shared ownership are essential for success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Periodic travel to the United States is expected for offsites, planning sessions, and collaboration. Occasional travel within the UK and Ireland may also be required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not sure if you check every box?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great engineers come from all kinds of backgrounds. We value &lt;strong&gt;impact, technical leadership, and a growth mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;just as much as specific tool experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unfortunately, we do not offer sponsorship and you do need to be living in the UK or Ireland to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE—a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connection and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Strategic Sales team at SevenRooms is on a mission to reshape the hospitality industry by helping the world’s leading hotel, restaurant and leisure groups own their guest relationships. We partner with multi-venue operators across EMEA as trusted advisors: we take a consultative approach, uncover gaps in how groups manage guest data, operations and distribution, and design solutions that reduce reliance on third-party networks and drive measurable revenue. Since SevenRooms joined DoorDash, we work alongside DoorDash and Deliveroo teams to bring merchants a connected offer across discovery, reservations, delivery and on-premise dining.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring an experienced Strategic Account Executive to uncover, drive and close new business with enterprise hospitality groups across EMEA. You will focus on hotel groups, multi-brand restaurant groups, and other large multi-venue operators (typically 50+ locations), selling the full SevenRooms platform: CRM and guest data, marketing automation, reservations and waitlist, table and revenue management, events and experiences, online ordering, Voice AI, and group reporting. These are complex, multi-stakeholder, multi-year deals, so you will navigate matrixed organisations, build executive-level relationships and structure commercial agreements that scale across venues and regions. You will work closely with Product, Solutions, Customer Success and Onboarding to make sure every enterprise partner launches successfully and grows with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win new enterprise logos.&lt;/strong&gt; Own a named-account strategy across hotel and restaurant groups with 50+ venues, building and running a pipeline through targeted outbound, partnerships, industry events and executive networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles.&lt;/strong&gt; Map decision-makers across operations, marketing, IT, finance, procurement and group leadership, and build consensus around a clear business case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sell a platform, not a point solution.&lt;/strong&gt; Articulate how SevenRooms unifies guest data across venues to drive direct bookings, repeat visits, higher spend per cover and lower commission costs, and tailor the story to each group’s priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the full sales lifecycle.&lt;/strong&gt; Take deals from first conversation through discovery, executive presentations and live demos, commercial and financial deal structuring, RFP responses, security and legal review, contract negotiation and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiate multi-year, multi-venue agreements.&lt;/strong&gt; Structure pricing, rollout phasing and contract terms across brands, regions and entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner cross-functionally.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Solutions Consulting, Product, Engineering, Marketing, Onboarding, Customer Success and DoorDash and Deliveroo teams to shape rollout plans, integrations and long-term account growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a trusted advisor.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring market insight, benchmarks and hospitality expertise to senior operators, and champion their success well beyond signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 8+ years of B2B enterprise SaaS sales experience with a consistent record of meeting and exceeding quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience selling complex, multi-faceted platforms to mid-market and enterprise customers, ideally in hospitality, hotels, restaurants, leisure or adjacent verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep knowledge of, or strong relationships within, the hotel and hospitality industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building relationships with C-level and executive stakeholders and navigating large, matrixed organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience structuring and negotiating complex, multi-year deals, and managing RFPs, procurement and security reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an outstanding presenter in person and virtually, with strong business acumen and natural curiosity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are self-driven, organised and comfortable managing a long, multi-threaded pipeline with forecast discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are tech-savvy and quick to learn new tools; you have worked with Salesforce, RFP management tools or similar systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are open to regular travel across EMEA to meet clients face-to-face&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: fluency in a second European language, and experience selling CRM, marketing, reservations, PMS or POS technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SevenRooms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2011, Joel Montaniel, Allison Page, and Kinesh Patel founded SevenRooms after noticing that hospitality operators were missing a critical ingredient in the systems they were using to run their business: guest data. What began as a mission to help restaurants better understand and serve their guests evolved into a powerful platform used by merchants around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With best-in-class tools for marketing, operations, and guest experience — all deeply integrated with its industry-leading CRM — SevenRooms empowers operators to drive revenue, streamline operations, and deliver experiences that keep guests coming back.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2025, DoorDash acquired SevenRooms to strengthen its in-store strategy and expand its merchant-first offerings. The combination brings together DoorDash’s scale, reach, and digital innovation with SevenRooms’ in-store capabilities to support hospitality businesses across every channel — from discovery and delivery to on-premise dining.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As DoorDash builds out its in-store capabilities, SevenRooms plays a central role in enabling merchants to grow their businesses and connect more meaningfully with guests, whether they’re ordering online or dining in. This move reflects DoorDash’s broader commitment to empowering local businesses, fostering stronger connections between consumers and the places they love, and building technology that meets merchants — and their customers — wherever they are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;72d9cead-5d7c-511f-a089-41bc1b2ad175|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[335559740,&amp;quot;253&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Arial,Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;Body text Optiver&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;BodytextOptiver&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Zsysbasis Optiver&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Legal Europe is a trusted partner to the business, playing a critical role in enabling commercial growth while managing legal and regulatory risk for our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;European trading&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; businesses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; looking for an experienced financial markets lawyer who can &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;operate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; as a trusted adviser to the business from day one. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; lead complex negotiations, advise senior stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and take ownership of significant legal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; in a fast-moving environment where &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;your&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; advice has &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;direct commercial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;72d9cead-5d7c-511f-a089-41bc1b2ad175|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[335559740,&amp;quot;253&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Arial,Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;22&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;Body text Optiver&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;BodytextOptiver&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Zsysbasis Optiver&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;As a Senior Legal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Counsel,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; will work closely with trading, compliance, risk, finance, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and technology teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;. You will support the businesses and trading desks covered by the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Legal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Europe &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;team, including our European listed derivatives, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;commodities,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and systematic trading businesses. The role is primarily focused on listed markets and market infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Proximity to trading is fundamental to the way we work. You will partner directly with traders and business leaders, developing a deep understanding of the products, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;markets,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; and commercial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt; of the desks you support. Experience advising on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;relevant &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;trading products or market structures will be a significant advantage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body text Optiver&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:253}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
